msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: BlazBlue Calamity Trigger Ukrainian Translation\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Language: uk\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=3; plural=(n%10==1 && n%100!=11 ? 0 : n%10>=2 && n%10<=4 && (n%100<10 || n%100>=20) ? 1 : 2);\n"

#. Key: RCL0_001
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 中庭を照らす清らかな月光。
#. JA:   あたりを覆うのは薔薇の香。
#. JA:   そこに混じった紅茶の匂い。
msgctxt "RCL0_001"
msgid ""
"Moonlight shines gently on the courtyard.\n"
"The air is heavy with the scent of roses and black tea."
msgstr ""
"Чисте місячне сяйво освітлює внутрішній дворик. Довкола пахнуть\n"
"троянди, а до їхнього аромату домішується запах чаю."

#. Key: RCL0_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   草木を撫で、揺らしていく優しい風。
#. JA:   聞こえてくる規則的な寝息。
#. JA:   
msgctxt "RCL0_002"
msgid ""
"\n"
"The wind gently caresses the leaves, and I can vaguely hear the almost systematic\n"
"breaths of people sleeping.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Лагідний вітер колише листя й трави. Чути рівне дихання тих, хто\n"
"спить.\n"

#. Key: RCL0_003
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いつもと変わらない平穏な日々。
#. JA:   “また”始まってしまった日常。
#. JA:   長<ruby>　の</ruby>閑<ruby>どか　</ruby>で、穏やかで、けれど―――
msgctxt "RCL0_003"
msgid ""
"A dreadfully normal day has begun.\n"
"The <DQ>routine<DQ> has started once again.\n"
"It's nice...and peaceful. But still..."
msgstr ""
"Такі самі, як завжди, мирні дні. Буденність, що почалася «знову».\n"
"Тривала, спокійна, безтурботна, але..."

#. Key: RCL0_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……退屈ね。
msgctxt "RCL0_004"
msgid "...I'm bored."
msgstr "...Нудно."

#. Key: RCL0_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: お疲れですか……？　レイチェル様。
msgctxt "RCL0_006"
msgid "Do you feel tired, madam?"
msgstr "Ви стомилися, пані Рейчел?"

#. Key: RCL0_007
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いえ、そんなことはないわ。
msgctxt "RCL0_007"
msgid "No, not really."
msgstr "Ні, анітрохи."

#. Key: RCL0_008
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: でしたら宜しいのですが……。
msgctxt "RCL0_008"
msgid "I do hope that is the truth..."
msgstr "Тоді я спокійний..."

#. Key: RCL0_009
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL0_009"
msgid "Thank you... Today's tea is exquisite."
msgstr "Дякую... Сьогодні чай напрочуд добрий."

#. Key: RCL0_011
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 本日の紅茶はアマルガから取り寄せましたもので……。
#. JA:   芳醇な香りを楽しんで頂ければと。
msgctxt "RCL0_011"
msgid ""
"You are too kind, madam.\n"
"Today's tea has been imported from Amaruga. I thought perhaps you would\n"
"appreciate its rich aroma."
msgstr ""
"Сьогоднішній чай привезли з Амалґи... Я сподівався, що його насичений\n"
"аромат вам сподобається."

#. Key: RCL0_012
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そう……。通りで、いつものものより―――。
msgctxt "RCL0_012"
msgid "I see... I do detect a subtle difference in flavor..."
msgstr "Он як... То ось чому він не такий, як зазвичай..."

#. Key: RCL0_014
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL0_014"
msgid "!?"
msgstr "?!"

#. Key: RCL0_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL0_016"
msgid "...!"
msgstr "...!"

#. Key: RCL0_017
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 今のは……！
msgctxt "RCL0_017"
msgid "What the deuce...?"
msgstr "Що це було...?!"

#. Key: RCL0_019
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: レイチェル様、いかがなされました？
msgctxt "RCL0_019"
msgid "Madam Rachel, is something amiss?"
msgstr "Пані Рейчел, щось трапилося?"

#. Key: RCL0_021
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……あ。
#. JA:   ええ、大丈夫よ……少し、驚いただけ。
msgctxt "RCL0_021"
msgid "...Ah. N-No, I'm fine... My nerves, you see."
msgstr "...А. Так, усе гаразд... Я лише трохи здивувалася."

#. Key: RCL0_022
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: お休みになられるのなら寝所の準備を致しますが……。
msgctxt "RCL0_022"
msgid ""
"If you wish to rest, I will see to it that the bedchamber is made ready for you\n"
"straightaway..."
msgstr "Якщо бажаєте відпочити, я підготую спальню..."

#. Key: RCL0_024
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いえ、それよりもう一杯お茶を。
msgctxt "RCL0_024"
msgid "I appreciate the concern, Valkenhayn, but all that I require is more tea."
msgstr "Ні, краще налий мені ще чаю."

#. Key: RCL0_025
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 畏まりました。
#. JA:   それではすぐに淹れて参ります。
#. JA:   少々、お待ち下さいませ。
msgctxt "RCL0_025"
msgid "Of course, madam. I shall prepare a second pot posthaste."
msgstr "Як накажете. Зараз заварю свіжий. Прошу зачекати хвилинку."

#. Key: RCL0_027
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ふう……。
msgctxt "RCL0_027"
msgid "*sigh*"
msgstr "Фух..."

#. Key: RCL0_028
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 空を見上げると、月は相変わらず清らかな光を放っていた。
msgctxt "RCL0_028"
msgid ""
"I look up at the sky, at the moon shining like a lustrous pearl in the heavens,\n"
"surrounded by its retinue of shimmering stars..."
msgstr "Я підводжу погляд до неба. Місяць, як і раніше, сяє чистим світлом."

#. Key: RCL0_029
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そしてそれを取り巻く無数の星達。
#. JA:   その星のひとつを、私は見つめていた。
msgctxt "RCL0_029"
msgid "...but it is one of those stars that interests me, not their lord the moon."
msgstr "Навколо нього мерехтять незліченні зорі. Я дивлюся на одну з них."

#. Key: RCL0_030
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それは凶星。
msgctxt "RCL0_030"
msgid "A star of ill omen."
msgstr "Це лиховісна зоря."

#. Key: RCL0_031
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 世界が乱れる時にひときわ輝くとされる星。
#. JA:   その凶星が、数分前に空を見上げた時に比べ、
#. JA:   微かに位置を変えているのに私は気付いた。
msgctxt "RCL0_031"
msgid ""
"A star that shines its brightest when the earth is on the brink of destruction.\n"
"As I look at that star, I realize...it has moved, but only ever so slightly..."
msgstr ""
"Кажуть, вона сяє найяскравіше, коли у світі настає безлад. Я помітила:\n"
"відтоді як кілька хвилин тому глянула на небо, ця зоря ледь змінила\n"
"своє положення."

#. Key: RCL0_032
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 星が……。
msgctxt "RCL0_032"
msgid "The stars..."
msgstr "Зоря..."

#. Key: RCL0_033
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それが何を意味するのかを、私は知っていた。
msgctxt "RCL0_033"
msgid "I know what it means."
msgstr "Я знаю, що це означає."

#. Key: RCL0_034
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私は思う。
#. JA:   ついに現われたのだと。
msgctxt "RCL0_034"
msgid "I know that, once again, the time has come."
msgstr "Я подумала: нарешті він з'явився."

#. Key: RCL0_035
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私は思う。
#. JA:   ついにその時が来たのだと。
msgctxt "RCL0_035"
msgid "I know that, once again, that terrible thing will make its debut."
msgstr "Я подумала: нарешті настав той час."

#. Key: RCL0_036
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私は思う。
#. JA:   ついに世界が終るのだと。
msgctxt "RCL0_036"
msgid "I know that, once again, the world is about to end."
msgstr "Я подумала: нарешті світу настане кінець."

#. Key: RCL0_037
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私は立ち上がった。
#. JA:   そして、かたわらで眠るナゴとギィを蹴り飛ばす。
msgctxt "RCL0_037"
msgid "I stand and delicately prod Nago and Gii with my foot."
msgstr "Я підвелася й копнула Наґо та Ґі, що спали поруч."

#. Key: RCL0_039
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ウニャッ!?
msgctxt "RCL0_039"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr "Няв?!"

#. Key: RCL0_040
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: い、痛いッス、姫様！
msgctxt "RCL0_040"
msgid "O-Owwww, that hurt, Princess!"
msgstr "Б-боляче, принцесо!"

#. Key: RCL0_042
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いつまで寝ているの、出かけるわよ！
msgctxt "RCL0_042"
msgid ""
"Do you do anything but sleep?\n"
"Come. We are going out."
msgstr "Скільки ще спатимете? Ми вирушаємо!"

#. Key: RCL0_043
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 出かけるって……。
#. JA:   さっき帰ってきたばっかりっス！
#. JA:   いつも帰ってきたらしばらくはのんびりタイムっス！
msgctxt "RCL0_043"
msgid ""
"G-Going out... But we just got back!\n"
"We usually get some time to relax before we have to go out again..."
msgstr ""
"Вирушаємо?.. Ми ж щойно повернулися! Зазвичай після повернення нам\n"
"дають трохи відпочити!"

#. Key: RCL0_044
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 事情が変わったのよ。さ、準備なさい。
msgctxt "RCL0_044"
msgid ""
"The situation has changed.\n"
"Get ready. Now."
msgstr "Обставини змінилися. Готуйтеся."

#. Key: RCL0_045
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 事情はよく分からないけど……。
#. JA:   何かやるべき時が来たんだね、姫様？
msgctxt "RCL0_045"
msgid ""
"I'm not sure what you're talking about, but...the time has come for us to act, right?\n"
"Oh my goodness!"
msgstr ""
"Не дуже розумію, що відбувається... Але настав час щось зробити,\n"
"принцесо?"

#. Key: RCL0_046
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: さあ、どうかしらね……。
#. JA:   それを確かめに行くのよ。
msgctxt "RCL0_046"
msgid "I am not sure myself... But that is what I intend to find out."
msgstr "Хтозна... Саме це ми й перевіримо."

#. Key: RCL0_047
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ふふ……久しぶりだわ。
#. JA:   こんなに胸が躍るのは……。
msgctxt "RCL0_047"
msgid "Hehe... It has been a while since I felt this kind of excitement."
msgstr "Хі-хі... Давно я не відчувала такого хвилювання..."

#. Key: RCL0_050
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: レイチェル様、新しくお茶を―――。
msgctxt "RCL0_050"
msgid "Your tea, madam—"
msgstr "Пані Рейчел, я приніс свіжий чай..."

#. Key: RCL0_052
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: おや、もう行ってしまわれたか……。
msgctxt "RCL0_052"
msgid "Ah... Gone already? They grow up so fast..."
msgstr "Он як, уже пішла..."

#. Key: RCL0_054
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 仕方がないですな。
#. JA:   後片付けをすると致しましょうか。
msgctxt "RCL0_054"
msgid ""
"A shame this tea shall go to waste...\n"
"Ah well, a good house is a tidy house..."
msgstr "Нічого не вдієш. Час усе прибрати."

#. Key: RCL0_056
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL0_056"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL0_058
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: む……。
msgctxt "RCL0_058"
msgid "Hm?"
msgstr "Гм..."

#. Key: RCL0_061
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL0_061"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL0_062
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 久しぶりだな、オッサン。
msgctxt "RCL0_062"
msgid "Long time, no see, old man."
msgstr "Давно не бачилися, старий."

#. Key: RCL0_063
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 相変わらず、品性の欠片もない物言いだな。
msgctxt "RCL0_063"
msgid "You have changed little, I see. No sense of propriety whatsoever."
msgstr "Твої манери, як завжди, залишають бажати кращого."

#. Key: RCL0_064
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ここは貴様のような者が足を踏み入れてよい場所ではない。
#. JA:   早々に立ち去るがいい。
msgctxt "RCL0_064"
msgid ""
"A man such as you is not welcome in a place such as this. I would humbly request\n"
"that you leave. Immediately."
msgstr "Таким, як ти, тут не місце. Забирайся негайно."

#. Key: RCL0_066
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: おいおい、つめてーなぁ。
#. JA:   昔の仲間だろ？
msgctxt "RCL0_066"
msgid "Hey now, don't be so cold. Don't we go way back?"
msgstr "Та годі тобі, чого такий холодний? Ми ж давні товариші."

#. Key: RCL0_067
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: こっちはこんな花くせぇところでさんざ待ってたんだぜ。
#. JA:   あのクソ吸血鬼にゃ、会いたくもねぇからよ。
msgctxt "RCL0_067"
msgid ""
"I've had to spend hours surrounded by the stench of these flowers because\n"
"I don't wanna see that damn vampire."
msgstr ""
"Я тут добряче прочекав серед цих смердючих квітів. І все тому, що не\n"
"хотів бачитися з тією клятою вампіркою."

#. Key: RCL0_068
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……聞こえなかったか？　去れと言ったはずだ！
msgctxt "RCL0_068"
msgid "...I'm terribly sorry. Perhaps you did not hear me. I believe I asked you to leave."
msgstr "...Ти не почув? Я наказав тобі піти!"

#. Key: RCL0_069
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 声の威圧とともに、鋭いハイキックを放つヴァルケンハイン。
#. JA:   しかし、その攻撃は虚しく空気をかき分け、相手に届くことはなかった。
msgctxt "RCL0_069"
msgid ""
"With a grunt, Valkenhayn throws all in strength into a kick, but it comes up short,\n"
"merely grazing his target."
msgstr ""
"Із погрозливим вигуком Валькенгайн завдає різкого удару ногою. Та\n"
"удар лише розтинає повітря й не дістає супротивника."

#. Key: RCL0_070
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ムダムダ、ムダだってーの。
#. JA:   分かってるくせに。
msgctxt "RCL0_070"
msgid "Hahaha, just forget it, man! There's no use. You should know that."
msgstr "Марно, марно. Сам знаєш."

#. Key: RCL0_071
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それともそんなことも理解できないくらい
#. JA:   カッカきちゃってるわけ？
msgctxt "RCL0_071"
msgid "Don't tell me you're going senile."
msgstr "Чи ти так розлютився, що вже не здатен цього збагнути?"

#. Key: RCL0_072
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 俺なんか気に障ること言った？
#. JA:   クソをクソと呼んだのが悪いってか？
#. JA:   ひゃひゃひゃ……。そりゃ無茶な道理だぜ。
msgctxt "RCL0_072"
msgid ""
"Aww, did I hit a nerve? Hahaha, you're mad at me for telling the truth?\n"
"Hahaha! What kind of logic is that?"
msgstr ""
"Я сказав щось образливе? Не можна називати лайно лайном? Хі-хі-хі...\n"
"Безглузде правило."

#. Key: RCL0_073
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL0_073"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL0_075
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: お？　まだやるか？
msgctxt "RCL0_075"
msgid "Oh? You wanna keep goin'?"
msgstr "О? Хочеш продовжити?"

#. Key: RCL0_077
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 冷静になったと思ったら、お片付けかよ。
#. JA:   マメだねぇ、相変わらず。
msgctxt "RCL0_077"
msgid ""
"Just when I thought you had calmed down, you start cleaning...As square as always,\n"
"eh?"
msgstr ""
"Тільки-но, гадав, ти заспокоївся — вже прибираєш. Такий самий\n"
"хазяйновитий, як завжди."

#. Key: RCL0_078
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……何をしに来た。
msgctxt "RCL0_078"
msgid "...Enough. What do you want?"
msgstr "...Навіщо ти прийшов?"

#. Key: RCL0_079
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 別に。
#. JA:   ただ、あんたは気付いてるのかなーと思ってね。
msgctxt "RCL0_079"
msgid "Nothing really. I was just wondering if you've realized yet."
msgstr "Та так. Просто хотів дізнатися, чи ти помітив."

#. Key: RCL0_081
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 何のことだ？
msgctxt "RCL0_081"
msgid "What on earth are you talking about?"
msgstr "Що саме?"

#. Key: RCL0_082
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……星が動いてるぜ？
msgctxt "RCL0_082"
msgid "...The stars are moving."
msgstr "...Зоря рухається."

#. Key: RCL0_084
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: これは……私としたことが！
msgctxt "RCL0_084"
msgid "P-Poppycock!"
msgstr "Це... Як же я не помітив?!"

#. Key: RCL0_085
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 大事なお嬢ちゃんが無事だといいな。
#. JA:   ま、言いたかったのはそれだけさ。じゃな～。
msgctxt "RCL0_085"
msgid ""
"I hope your precious little lady is all right. Well, that's all I really wanted to say.\n"
"See ya around."
msgstr ""
"Сподіваюся, з твоєю любою дівчинкою все гаразд. Це все, що я хотів\n"
"сказати. Ну бувай."

#. Key: RCL0_087
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL0_087"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL0_089
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: もう歳ですかね、私も。
msgctxt "RCL0_089"
msgid "Oh, dear... Perhaps old age is getting the better of me."
msgstr "Мабуть, і я вже старію."

#. Key: RCL0_090
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: “アレ”に気付かなかったとは失態だ……。
msgctxt "RCL0_090"
msgid "I did not notice..."
msgstr "Не помітити цього — неабиякий промах..."

#. Key: RCL0_091
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: レイチェル様、すぐに参ります。
#. JA:   どうかご無事で……。
msgctxt "RCL0_091"
msgid "I am on my way, Madam Rachel. I pray for your safety..."
msgstr "Пані Рейчел, я вже йду до вас. Прошу, бережіть себе..."

#. Key: RCL1_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……何もないところね。
#. JA:   なぜこんなところに転移してしまったのかしら……？
msgctxt "RCL1_002"
msgid "...How barren. How did we end up here...?"
msgstr "...Геть порожнє місце. Як ми сюди перенеслися...?"

#. Key: RCL1_003
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あらら、姫様でも失敗する時があるんだねぇ。
msgctxt "RCL1_003"
msgid "I guess even you can make some mistakes, Princess..."
msgstr "Ого, навіть принцеса часом помиляється."

#. Key: RCL1_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_004"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL1_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はぐっ！
msgctxt "RCL1_006"
msgid "Hargh!"
msgstr "Угх!"

#. Key: RCL1_007
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……ひ、姫様！
#. JA:   誰か来るッス！
msgctxt "RCL1_007"
msgid "...P-Princess...! Someone's coming!"
msgstr "П-принцесо! Сюди хтось іде!"

#. Key: RCL1_008
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 言われなくても気付いているわ。
#. JA:   少しその口を閉じてなさい……。
msgctxt "RCL1_008"
msgid "I have eyes, Gii. Now shut your ugly mouth before I remove it from your face."
msgstr "Я й без тебе помітила. Помовчи трохи..."

#. Key: RCL1_010
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_010"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL1_011
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あら坊や、ごきげんよう。
msgctxt "RCL1_011"
msgid "Hello there, child. How do you do?"
msgstr "Добридень, хлопчику."

#. Key: RCL1_012
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 君は……魔女？
#. JA:   何もないところから突然現れたけど……。
msgctxt "RCL1_012"
msgid "Are you...a witch? You came out of nowhere..."
msgstr "Ти... відьма? Ти щойно виникла з нічого..."

#. Key: RCL1_013
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 見間違えじゃないかしら？
#. JA:   その大きなメガネはお飾り？
#. JA:   もう一度視力を検査した方が良いのでなくて？
msgctxt "RCL1_013"
msgid ""
"I beg your pardon? Clearly those ostentatious eyeglasses do your eyes no good.\n"
"Perhaps they would serve you better forcibly inserted into your mouth."
msgstr ""
"Може, тобі здалося? Ці величезні окуляри — просто прикраса? Раджу ще\n"
"раз перевірити зір."

#. Key: RCL1_014
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姉さん、どう思う……？
#. JA:   この人のこと……。
msgctxt "RCL1_014"
msgid "What do you think, Sis...? About this person..."
msgstr "Сестро, що ти думаєш... про цю особу?"

#. Key: RCL1_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: !?
#. JA:   姉さん？　どうしたのっ!?
msgctxt "RCL1_016"
msgid ""
"!?\n"
"Sis? What's the matter!?"
msgstr "?! Сестро? Що з тобою?!"

#. Key: RCL1_017
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あいつ、ずっと人形に話しかけてるよ、姫様……。
#. JA:   関わらない方が良くない？
msgctxt "RCL1_017"
msgid "Milady, that guy's talking to a puppet... I think we should keep on walking."
msgstr ""
"Принцесо, він увесь час розмовляє з лялькою... Може, не варто з ним\n"
"зв'язуватися?"

#. Key: RCL1_018
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 相変わらず姉離れのできていない坊やね……。
#. JA:   見ていて少し苛々するわ。
msgctxt "RCL1_018"
msgid ""
"Still depending on your sister at your age? How pitifully sad. How dreadfully\n"
"irritating."
msgstr "Ти, як завжди, не можеш відірватися від сестри. Дратує."

#. Key: RCL1_019
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: “危険”？　あの人が危険だって言うのかい？
msgctxt "RCL1_019"
msgid "<DQ>Dangerous<DQ>? You're saying that person is dangerous?"
msgstr "«Небезпечна»? Ти кажеш, що вона небезпечна?"

#. Key: RCL1_020
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 小柄な身の丈からは想像もつかないほどの威圧感を
#. JA:   レイチェルから感じ取ったカルルが素早く身構える。
msgctxt "RCL1_020"
msgid ""
"Carl, realizing how dangerous Rachel truly is, quickly steps back and readies himself\n"
"for a fight."
msgstr ""
"Карл відчуває від Рейчел такий тиск, якого не чекав від маленької\n"
"дівчини, й миттю стає в бойову стійку."

#. Key: RCL1_021
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 君は一体……。
#. JA:   こんなこと、今までなかったのに……。
#. JA:   姉さんが僕以外の人間に反応するなんて……。
msgctxt "RCL1_021"
msgid ""
"Who in the world are you...? This has never happened before...\n"
"Sis is reacting to someone other than myself...?"
msgstr ""
"Хто ти така...? Ніколи такого не було... Сестра реагує на когось, крім\n"
"мене..."

#. Key: RCL1_022
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方はマナーという言葉を知っているかしら？
#. JA:   初対面のレディに対して“危険”だなんて、随分と教養がないのね。
msgctxt "RCL1_022"
msgid ""
"Have you ever heard of the word <DQ>manners<DQ>? Inquiring about a lady's nature is not\n"
"only rude, it is the very height of impropriety!"
msgstr ""
"Чи знаєш ти слово «манери»? Називати пані, яку щойно зустрів,\n"
"«небезпечною» — це неабияке невігластво."

#. Key: RCL1_023
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 危険だ……。分からないけど、君は危険な存在だ。
#. JA:   姉さんがそう言ってる！
msgctxt "RCL1_023"
msgid ""
"You're dangerous... I'm not really sure why, but you're a dangerous individual.\n"
"My sister said so!"
msgstr ""
"Ти небезпечна... Не знаю чому, але ти становиш загрозу. Так каже\n"
"сестра!"

#. Key: RCL1_028
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 意外とやるのね……。
#. JA:   これも“ズレ”の一部なのかしら……。
msgctxt "RCL1_028"
msgid "Not bad... Might this be a consequence of the shift?"
msgstr "Неочікувано вправний... Може, це теж наслідок зсуву...?"

#. Key: RCL1_029
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そういうの、負け惜しみというんですよ。
#. JA:   それよりも、君はなにか知っているみたいだ。
#. JA:   話してもらいますよ、色々とね……。
msgctxt "RCL1_029"
msgid ""
"It's called <DQ>being a sore loser<DQ>. Or perhaps you know something I don't...\n"
"If that's the case, I'll have you answer my questions."
msgstr ""
"Це називається «виправданням поразки». До того ж ти, схоже, щось\n"
"знаєш. Тож розкажеш мені все..."

#. Key: RCL1_030
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ひ、姫様……やばいよ……。
msgctxt "RCL1_030"
msgid "P-Princess, this doesn't look good..."
msgstr "П-принцесо... Справи кепські..."

#. Key: RCL1_032
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 執事さんっ！！
msgctxt "RCL1_032"
msgid "Valkenhayn!"
msgstr "Дворецький!!"

#. Key: RCL1_033
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: やれやれ、何とか間に合いましたか……。
msgctxt "RCL1_033"
msgid "Oh, my... I see I was only just in time."
msgstr "Отакої. Здається, я ледве встиг..."

#. Key: RCL1_034
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_034"
msgid "...?"
msgstr "...?"

#. Key: RCL1_036
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: うっ……！
msgctxt "RCL1_036"
msgid "Ugh...!"
msgstr "Ух...!"

#. Key: RCL1_037
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: どうやらまだ時期ではないようですな。
#. JA:   さ、帰りましょう、レイチェル様。
msgctxt "RCL1_037"
msgid ""
"It would seem the time is not yet right.\n"
"Let us retire to the castle, milady."
msgstr "Схоже, час ще не настав. Ходімо додому, пані Рейчел."

#. Key: RCL1_038
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: どうやらそのようね……。
#. JA:   口惜しいけど、仕方がないわ……。
msgctxt "RCL1_038"
msgid "So it would seem. A shame, but I suppose I have done my utmost."
msgstr "Схоже на те... Шкода, але нічого не вдієш..."

#. Key: RCL1_040
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: また、待たねばならないのね。
#. JA:   未来永劫続く、この世<ruby>オ</ruby>界<ruby>リ</ruby>の中で……。
msgctxt "RCL1_040"
msgid "It is back to waiting, then. Waiting, in this cage where time never ends."
msgstr "Доведеться знову чекати. У цьому світі-клітці, що триває вічно..."

#. Key: RCL1_045
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ううっ……姉さん……。
msgctxt "RCL1_045"
msgid "Ungh...Sis..."
msgstr "У-у... Сестро..."

#. Key: RCL1_046
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: まったく……。
#. JA:   ガキンチョの分際で姫様に楯突こうなんて、
#. JA:   五億年くらい早いってんだよ！
msgctxt "RCL1_046"
msgid "Hah! You mean you thought you stood a chance against the princess?"
msgstr ""
"Подумати лишень... Таке мале, а вже насмілилося перечити принцесі!\n"
"Тобі до цього ще п'ятсот мільйонів років рости!"

#. Key: RCL1_047
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: で、姫様？　コイツどうするッスか？
msgctxt "RCL1_047"
msgid "What should we do with this boy, milady?"
msgstr "Принцесо, що робити з цим хлопцем?"

#. Key: RCL1_048
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そうね……。
msgctxt "RCL1_048"
msgid "Let's see..."
msgstr "Подумаю..."

#. Key: RCL1_049
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 放っておきましょう。
msgctxt "RCL1_049"
msgid "Let us leave him."
msgstr "Залишімо його."

#. Key: RCL1_050
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: もう少し躾が必要かしら？
msgctxt "RCL1_050"
msgid "I believe he requires a lesson in manners."
msgstr "Може, його ще трохи провчити?"

#. Key: RCL1_054
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 放っておきましょう。
#. JA:   充分、反省はしたでしょうから……。
msgctxt "RCL1_054"
msgid "I would rather leave him, that he may live to regret his actions."
msgstr "Залишімо його. Гадаю, він уже збагнув свою помилку..."

#. Key: RCL1_055
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様が見逃すなんて……。
msgctxt "RCL1_055"
msgid "The princess letting someone go...?"
msgstr "Принцеса когось відпускає...?"

#. Key: RCL1_056
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そういうことだから、姫様に感謝しな、ガキンチョっ！
msgctxt "RCL1_056"
msgid "You have no idea how lucky you are."
msgstr "Отож дякуй принцесі, малий!"

#. Key: RCL1_057
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: では、ごきげんよう、坊や……。
msgctxt "RCL1_057"
msgid "I shall see you around, child. Good day."
msgstr "Що ж, бувай, хлопчику..."

#. Key: RCL1_059
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: くっ……。ぼ、僕は……っ！！
msgctxt "RCL1_059"
msgid "G-Guh... I...I'm...!"
msgstr "Кх... Я... Я...!"

#. Key: RCL1_061
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nirvana
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_061"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL1_063
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: む……？
#. JA:   間に合いませんでしたか。
msgctxt "RCL1_063"
msgid "Eh? Oh dear... It would seem I have arrived too late."
msgstr "Гм...? Не встиг."

#. Key: RCL1_064
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: レイチェル様は先に進まれたようですな。
msgctxt "RCL1_064"
msgid "Madam Rachel is still on the move."
msgstr "Схоже, пані Рейчел уже рушила далі."

#. Key: RCL1_065
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nirvana
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_065"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL1_066
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: おや……お前は……？
msgctxt "RCL1_066"
msgid "Ah, I'm terribly sorry... You are...?"
msgstr "О... А ти...?"

#. Key: RCL1_068
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nirvana
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_068"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL1_069
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 久しいですな……。彼が今の君の主かね？
msgctxt "RCL1_069"
msgid "It has been some time... I take it this young gentlemen is your new master?"
msgstr "Давно не бачилися... Це він тепер твій господар?"

#. Key: RCL1_070
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nirvana
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_070"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL1_071
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: お互いに主を持つ身は大変だ……。どれ、手を貸そう。
msgctxt "RCL1_071"
msgid ""
"Having a master is rather difficult, wouldn't you agree?\n"
"Here, allow me to—"
msgstr "Нелегко нам обом служити господарям... Дозволь допомогти."

#. Key: RCL1_072
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nirvana
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_072"
msgid "...!"
msgstr "...!"

#. Key: RCL1_074
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 相変わらず心配症だ……。今の私は敵ではないよ。
msgctxt "RCL1_074"
msgid "As cautious as ever, I see. But I am no longer your enemy."
msgstr "Ти, як завжди, надто пильнуєш. Тепер я тобі не ворог."

#. Key: RCL1_075
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nirvana
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_075"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL1_076
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: なに、分かってくれればいいのだ。
msgctxt "RCL1_076"
msgid "Do not concern yourself. All that matters is that we can understand one another."
msgstr "Головне, що ти зрозуміла."

#. Key: RCL1_078
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: どれ……。確かオリエントタウンという所に腕の良い医者がいると
#. JA:   聞いたことがある。そこまで連れて行ってやろう。
msgctxt "RCL1_078"
msgid ""
"Let me see... Ah, I believe there is a rather skilled doctor in Orient Town.\n"
"I believe that will be my next stop."
msgstr "Здається, в Орієнт-тауні є вправна лікарка. Я віднесу його туди."

#. Key: RCL1_079
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 君も来るがいい。
msgctxt "RCL1_079"
msgid "Would you care to join me?"
msgstr "Ти теж ходімо."

#. Key: RCL1_080
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nirvana
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_080"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL1_084
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: もう少し躾が必要かしら……。
msgctxt "RCL1_084"
msgid "You are still in rather dire need of manners."
msgstr "Може, тебе ще трохи повчити манер..."

#. Key: RCL1_085
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それとも助けてほしい？　甘えん坊さん。
msgctxt "RCL1_085"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you would like to beg for mercy. Is that what you would like to do,\n"
"you spoiled brat?"
msgstr "Чи ти хочеш, щоб я тебе врятувала, розпещений хлопчику?"

#. Key: RCL1_086
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Carl
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: う、うっ……！
msgctxt "RCL1_086"
msgid "Ugh... U-Ugh...!"
msgstr "У-у...!"

#. Key: RCL1_087
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: さて、どうしてあげようかしら……。
msgctxt "RCL1_087"
msgid "How shall I punish you...?"
msgstr "І що мені з тобою робити...?"

#. Key: RCL1_089
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ふっふっふっ……。姫様のお仕置きは怖いよぉ。
msgctxt "RCL1_089"
msgid "Hehehe...you have no idea what the princess is capable of..."
msgstr "Хі-хі-хі... Покарання принцеси страшне."

#. Key: RCL1_090
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 待てーい！
msgctxt "RCL1_090"
msgid "Halt right there!"
msgstr "Стій!"

#. Key: RCL1_092
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 愛と正義の男、シシガミ＝バング、見参！
msgctxt "RCL1_092"
msgid "A man of love and justice, Bang Shishigami arrives!"
msgstr "Банґ Шішіґамі, борець за любов і справедливість, прибув!"

#. Key: RCL1_093
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 様子をうかがい、手出しは無用と見守っていたが……。
#. JA:   敗者に鞭打つなど不届き千万！
#. JA:   武士にあるまじき行為でござる！！
msgctxt "RCL1_093"
msgid ""
"I have been watching from afar... But how could you lay a finger on a man who is\n"
"already down...!? And you call yourself a warrior!"
msgstr ""
"Я спостерігав здалеку й не втручався, та знущатися з переможеного —\n"
"це нечуване лиходійство! Воїну не личить така поведінка!"

#. Key: RCL1_094
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それにそこの少年は拙者の可愛い後輩！
#. JA:   このシシガミ＝バング、義によって助太刀いたす！
msgctxt "RCL1_094"
msgid "That young man is my cute little disciple! I, Bang Shishigami, cannot overlook this!"
msgstr ""
"До того ж цей хлопчина — мій любий молодший поплічник! Я, Банґ\n"
"Шішіґамі, мушу допомогти йому заради справедливості!"

#. Key: RCL1_095
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……誰？
msgctxt "RCL1_095"
msgid "...Who?"
msgstr "...Хто ти?"

#. Key: RCL1_096
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: シシガミ＝バングと名乗ったであろうが！
msgctxt "RCL1_096"
msgid "I just said, I'm Bang Shishigami!"
msgstr "Я ж щойно назвався Банґом Шішіґамі!"

#. Key: RCL1_097
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……暑苦しいわね。
#. JA:   貴方には関係のないことだわ。お下がりなさい。
msgctxt "RCL1_097"
msgid ""
"...\n"
"This matter does not concern you. I suggest you leave."
msgstr "...Який же ти галасливий. Це тебе не стосується. Відійди."

#. Key: RCL1_098
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: だからその少年は拙者の後輩だと言っているではないか！
msgctxt "RCL1_098"
msgid "But I just told you! That boy is my apprentice!"
msgstr "Я ж сказав: цей хлопчина — мій молодший поплічник!"

#. Key: RCL1_099
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: その可愛らしい坊やと、貴方のような暑苦しい人間との間に
#. JA:   先輩後輩といった関わりがあるとは到底思えないけれど。
msgctxt "RCL1_099"
msgid ""
"You will excuse me if I find it difficult to believe this unsullied child would associate\n"
"with a...man...such as yourself."
msgstr ""
"Важко повірити, що цей милий хлопчик може бути поплічником такого\n"
"галасливого чоловіка, як ти."

#. Key: RCL1_100
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そのようなことはない！
#. JA:   その少年は拙者と同じ「咎追い」でござってな……。
msgctxt "RCL1_100"
msgid "That's not true! He's also a vigilante like myself."
msgstr "Ще й як може! Він теж мисливець за головами, як і я..."

#. Key: RCL1_101
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それに咎追いが戦う相手と言えば罪人と相場が決まっておる！
#. JA:   いかに少女のような容姿といえど、拙者は騙されぬぞ！
#. JA:   人を見かけで判断するほど、拙者は甘くはないのでござる！
msgctxt "RCL1_101"
msgid ""
"Besides, the kinds of fights vigilantes get involved in are very limited...which leads\n"
"me to believe that you have done something terrible. You cannot fool me with your\n"
"appearance!"
msgstr ""
"А мисливці за головами зазвичай б'ються зі злочинцями! Хоч ти й маєш\n"
"вигляд дівчинки, мене не обдуриш! Я не з тих, хто судить лише за\n"
"зовнішністю!"

#. Key: RCL1_102
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: さあ、尋常に立ち合えい！
msgctxt "RCL1_102"
msgid "Now, fight fair and square!"
msgstr "Ну ж бо, бийся чесно!"

#. Key: RCL1_103
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL1_103"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL1_105
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ナゴ、ギィ、行くわよ。
msgctxt "RCL1_105"
msgid "Nago, Gii, let's go."
msgstr "Наґо, Ґі, ходімо."

#. Key: RCL1_106
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はいよ！
msgctxt "RCL1_106"
msgid "All righty!"
msgstr "Авжеж!"

#. Key: RCL1_107
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様、あいつは放っておくッスか？
msgctxt "RCL1_107"
msgid "Milady, are we just leaving him?"
msgstr "Принцесо, просто залишимо його?"

#. Key: RCL1_108
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 興が覚めたわ……。
#. JA:   あんなむさ苦しい男は好みではないの。
msgctxt "RCL1_108"
msgid "You have failed to pique my curiosity, and I do not much care for sweaty men."
msgstr "Мені вже не цікаво... Такі смердючі чоловіки не в моєму смаку."

#. Key: RCL1_109
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: むうっ！
#. JA:   逃げる気か！腰ぬけめ！
msgctxt "RCL1_109"
msgid "Hm!? So you choose to run? You coward!"
msgstr "Гм! Надумала тікати? Боягузко!"

#. Key: RCL1_111
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 転移するわよ。
#. JA:   ここからなら直接「窯」のところまで行けるでしょう。
msgctxt "RCL1_111"
msgid ""
"This conversation is over. Now, we're going to jump from here straight to the\n"
"Cauldron."
msgstr "Перенесемося звідси. Здається, звідси можна потрапити просто до Котла."

#. Key: RCL1_112
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: させるかっ！
msgctxt "RCL1_112"
msgid "I won't let you!"
msgstr "Не дозволю!"

#. Key: RCL1_113
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……あっ！
msgctxt "RCL1_113"
msgid "...Ah!"
msgstr "...А!"

#. Key: RCL2_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: くそっ……お前……なんなんだ……！
#. JA:   ノエル＝ヴァーミリオン！　お前はっ……！
msgctxt "RCL2_002"
msgid "Dammit...who...are you...? Noel Vermillion! Are you...!"
msgstr "Чорт... Хто ж... ти така...?! Ноель Верміліон! Ти...!"

#. Key: RCL2_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: キ、キサラギ少佐！
#. JA:   しっかりして下さい！
#. JA:   今、医療班を呼びますから！
msgctxt "RCL2_004"
msgid "M-Major Kisaragi! Please hang in there! I'm calling a doctor right now!"
msgstr "М-майоре Кісараґі! Тримайтеся! Я зараз викличу медиків!"

#. Key: RCL2_005
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Jin
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL2_005"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL2_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: どうして少佐は私を……。
#. JA:   ひどく混乱なさっていたみたいだし……。
#. JA:   私……どうしたら……。
msgctxt "RCL2_006"
msgid ""
"Why did the Major attack me...? He seemed really disoriented...\n"
"What should I—"
msgstr ""
"Чому майор напав на мене...? Він здавався таким розгубленим... Що ж\n"
"мені робити...?"

#. Key: RCL2_008
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: わっ……!?
msgctxt "RCL2_008"
msgid "Eek...!"
msgstr "Ой...?!"

#. Key: RCL2_009
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あら？　今日は起きているのね？
msgctxt "RCL2_009"
msgid "Oh? Awake already, are you?"
msgstr "О? Сьогодні ти не спиш?"

#. Key: RCL2_010
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: え……？
msgctxt "RCL2_010"
msgid "Eh...?"
msgstr "Що...?"

#. Key: RCL2_012
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あ、私、のことですか？
msgctxt "RCL2_012"
msgid "A-Are you talking to me?"
msgstr "В-ви до мене звертаєтеся?"

#. Key: RCL2_013
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ここに私が話しかけるような相手が他にいて？
msgctxt "RCL2_013"
msgid "I see no one else here."
msgstr "Тут є ще хтось, до кого я могла б звернутися?"

#. Key: RCL2_014
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL2_014"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL2_015
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL2_015"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL2_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: な、なんか怖いッス……。
msgctxt "RCL2_016"
msgid "Sh-She's scary..."
msgstr "Якось страшно..."

#. Key: RCL2_017
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 黙ってな！
#. JA:   女の喧嘩は眼力がモノを云うのさ！
msgctxt "RCL2_017"
msgid ""
"Shh!\n"
"I've heard women can fight with just their eyes..."
msgstr "Мовчи! У жіночій сварці все вирішують погляди!"

#. Key: RCL2_018
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私、貴方の眼、嫌いだわ。
msgctxt "RCL2_018"
msgid "I don't like your eyes."
msgstr "Мені не подобаються твої очі."

#. Key: RCL2_019
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: い、いきなり何を……？
msgctxt "RCL2_019"
msgid "H-Huh...?"
msgstr "З-чого це раптом...?"

#. Key: RCL2_020
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それに……、
#. JA:   そんなモノに頼らないと
#. JA:   何もできないというのも情けない話ね……。
msgctxt "RCL2_020"
msgid "Don't you think it's rather pathetic to rely on those...things?"
msgstr "До того ж жалюгідно, що без оцих речей ти ні на що не здатна..."

#. Key: RCL2_021
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: な、何の話ですか！
msgctxt "RCL2_021"
msgid "Wh-What are you talking about?"
msgstr "П-про що ви?!"

#. Key: RCL2_022
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方が大事そうに抱えているオモチャよ。
#. JA:   それがないと貴方、まともに会話もできないんじゃなくて？
msgctxt "RCL2_022"
msgid "Those...little toys you insist on carrying with you. Can't even talk without it, can you?"
msgstr ""
"Про іграшки, які ти так дбайливо тримаєш. Без них ти, мабуть, і\n"
"розмовляти нормально не здатна?"

#. Key: RCL2_023
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そ、それは……。
msgctxt "RCL2_023"
msgid "Th-That's because..."
msgstr "А-але ж..."

#. Key: RCL2_024
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そのオドオドした態度もおやめなさい。
#. JA:   まったく、イライラさせるばかりね、貴方。
msgctxt "RCL2_024"
msgid ""
"Oh for goodness sake, child, make up your mind! Your behavior sickens me,\n"
"although I can't say I expected much."
msgstr "І припини так тремтіти. Ти тільки дратуєш мене."

#. Key: RCL2_025
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あ、あなたに一体私の何が分かるんですか！
msgctxt "RCL2_025"
msgid "Wh-What do you know about me!?"
msgstr "Щ-що ви взагалі про мене знаєте?!"

#. Key: RCL2_026
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL2_026"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL2_028
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: “何が分かるか”ですって？
#. JA:   そう……。いいわ。それが知りたいなら教えてあげる。
msgctxt "RCL2_028"
msgid ""
"What do -I- know about -you-? So you really want to know?\n"
"OK... I shall indulge you."
msgstr "Що я знаю? Гаразд. Якщо хочеш знати, скажу."

#. Key: RCL2_029
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……ぜんぶよ。
msgctxt "RCL2_029"
msgid "...Everything."
msgstr "...Усе."

#. Key: RCL2_030
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ぜ……!?
msgctxt "RCL2_030"
msgid "Ev—!?"
msgstr "У-усе?!"

#. Key: RCL2_031
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 無駄話は止しましょう。
#. JA:   私は貴方を見極めなくてはならないの。
msgctxt "RCL2_031"
msgid ""
"Enough of this. I have not come here to experience your lamentable attempts\n"
"at conversation."
msgstr "Годі теревенів. Я мушу з'ясувати, чого ти варта."

#. Key: RCL2_032
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 本当に貴方に“変える力”があるのかどうかをね。
msgctxt "RCL2_032"
msgid "I am here to determine if you possess the power to change this world."
msgstr "Чи маєш ти справді силу змінити все."

#. Key: RCL2_037
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL2_037"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL2_038
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: お、大人しくしていて下さい……。
#. JA:   それ以上抵抗するなら、もう命の保証はできません……。
msgctxt "RCL2_038"
msgid "C-Calm down...! If you resist any more, I can't guarantee your safety!"
msgstr ""
"Б-будь ласка, не рухайтеся... Якщо й далі чинитимете опір, я не\n"
"гарантую вам життя..."

#. Key: RCL2_039
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……馬鹿。
msgctxt "RCL2_039"
msgid "...Idiot..."
msgstr "...Дурненька."

#. Key: RCL2_040
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: え？
msgctxt "RCL2_040"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Що?"

#. Key: RCL2_041
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: なにを勝った気でいるのかしら？
#. JA:   調子に乗らないで欲しいわね。
msgctxt "RCL2_041"
msgid "You think you've won, child? You would do well to temper your enthusiasm!"
msgstr "Чому ти вирішила, що перемогла? Не зазнавайся."

#. Key: RCL2_042
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方に少しくらい力があるといっても
#. JA:   命令されたことしか出来ないのでしょう？
msgctxt "RCL2_042"
msgid ""
"You may have a few tricks up your...sleeve, but that is all they are.\n"
"Simple parlor tricks, not real power! And all you know is to obey orders that\n"
"were given to you..."
msgstr ""
"Навіть маючи трохи сили, ти здатна лише виконувати чужі накази, чи\n"
"не так?"

#. Key: RCL2_043
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: え、いや、あの、私は……。
msgctxt "RCL2_043"
msgid "No, um, I was..."
msgstr "Ні, я... е-е..."

#. Key: RCL2_044
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 気分が悪いわ。
#. JA:   何、ぼんやりした顔をしているの？　さっさと去りなさい。
msgctxt "RCL2_044"
msgid "You disgust me. I say good day!"
msgstr ""
"Мене вже нудить від тебе. Чого стоїш із таким порожнім обличчям?\n"
"Забирайся."

#. Key: RCL2_045
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あ、あの、ちょっと……！
msgctxt "RCL2_045"
msgid "U-Um, wait...!"
msgstr "З-зачекайте...!"

#. Key: RCL2_046
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ギィ、ナゴ！
#. JA:   早く準備なさい。
#. JA:   何をボーッとしているの！
msgctxt "RCL2_046"
msgid ""
"Gii! Nago! We must depart at once!\n"
"Cease your dawdling!"
msgstr "Ґі, Наґо! Готуйтеся. Швидше! Чого завмерли?!"

#. Key: RCL2_048
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: い、痛いッス、姫様！
#. JA:   八つ当たりは良くない―――。
msgctxt "RCL2_048"
msgid "O-Oww, that hurt, Princess! Don't take your anger out on me—"
msgstr "Б-боляче, принцесо! Не треба зривати на мені злість..."

#. Key: RCL2_050
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: スゥッ！
msgctxt "RCL2_050"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr "Уй!"

#. Key: RCL2_051
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ナゴ！
#. JA:   早く飛ぶのよ！
msgctxt "RCL2_051"
msgid "Nago! Shut up and fly!"
msgstr "Наґо! Лети негайно!"

#. Key: RCL2_052
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 分かってるよ、もう……。
msgctxt "RCL2_052"
msgid "OK, OK..."
msgstr "Та знаю вже..."

#. Key: RCL2_054
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: な、なんでそこまで言われなきゃいけないの、私……。
msgctxt "RCL2_054"
msgid "Wh-Why do I have to be on the receiving end...?"
msgstr "З-за що вона так зі мною...?"

#. Key: RCL2_059
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: さ、オモチャは取り上げなきゃね。
msgctxt "RCL2_059"
msgid "I believe I will be taking those toys of yours now."
msgstr "Ну що ж, заберу твої іграшки."

#. Key: RCL2_062
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あ、あ……かえして！
#. JA:   かえしなさい！
msgctxt "RCL2_062"
msgid "A-Ah...give it back, please!"
msgstr "А-а... Віддай! Віддай мені!"

#. Key: RCL2_063
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それだいじなの！
#. JA:   ノエルのだいじなものなの！
#. JA:   だからかえして……かえしてください！
msgctxt "RCL2_063"
msgid ""
"Those are important. They're really important to me!\n"
"So please...give them back!"
msgstr "Вони мені дорогі! Дуже дорогі Ноель! Тому віддай... будь ласка, віддай!"

#. Key: RCL2_064
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……嫌。
msgctxt "RCL2_064"
msgid "...No."
msgstr "...Не хочу."

#. Key: RCL2_066
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あっ！！
msgctxt "RCL2_066"
msgid "Ah!"
msgstr "А!!"

#. Key: RCL2_068
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL2_068"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL2_070
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ああ、あああああ……。
msgctxt "RCL2_070"
msgid "*cry*"
msgstr "А-а, а-а-а-а..."

#. Key: RCL2_071
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ひ、ひどいよ……どうして……。
#. JA:   どうしてノエルのこといじめるの……。
#. JA:   どうして……。
msgctxt "RCL2_071"
msgid ""
"Why...Why do you have to be so mean to me?\n"
"Why...?"
msgstr "Т-ти така жорстока... Чому...? Чому ти кривдиш Ноель...? Чому...?"

#. Key: RCL2_072
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Noel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL2_072"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL2_073
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……絶望して放心？
msgctxt "RCL2_073"
msgid "...Is that all you can do?"
msgstr "...Зневірилася й заціпеніла?"

#. Key: RCL2_074
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: やっぱり駄目ね。
#. JA:   あんなモノがないと何もできないような存在では、
#. JA:   この世界を変えることなんて出来はしないわ……。
msgctxt "RCL2_074"
msgid ""
"How disappointing. Without your toys, you are nothing more than a hysterical child.\n"
"To think I thought you might change the world..."
msgstr ""
"Отже, я не помилилася. Якщо ти без оцих речей нічого не можеш, тобі\n"
"нізащо не змінити цей світ..."

#. Key: RCL2_075
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ナゴ、ギィ！
#. JA:   行くわよ。
msgctxt "RCL2_075"
msgid "Nago! Gii! Let us depart."
msgstr "Наґо, Ґі! Ми йдемо."

#. Key: RCL2_076
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago & Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はい！
msgctxt "RCL2_076"
msgid ""
"All righty!\n"
"Roger!"
msgstr "Так!"

#. Key: RCL3_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL3_002"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL3_003
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……貴方も懲りないわね、アルルカン。
msgctxt "RCL3_003"
msgid "How terribly persistent of you, Harlequin."
msgstr "...Ти теж ніяк не вгамуєшся, Арлекіне."

#. Key: RCL3_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 何故、此処に来た。
#. JA:   貴様、今更干渉する気か？
msgctxt "RCL3_004"
msgid "Why have you come here? Do you intend to intervene now?"
msgstr "Навіщо ти сюди прийшла? Невже тепер надумала втрутитися?"

#. Key: RCL3_005
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL3_005"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL3_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 何かが妙だった。
msgctxt "RCL3_006"
msgid "Something is strange..."
msgstr "Щось було не так."

#. Key: RCL3_007
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 目の前にいる「ハクメン」と呼ばれる男―――遠い過去に
#. JA:   英雄と呼ばれたこの者は、自らの信念に従いここに立っている。
#. JA:   決して変わることのない運命の輪を断ち切る為に……。
msgctxt "RCL3_007"
msgid ""
"There he is, standing before me—the man once known as Hakumen, a hero.\n"
"But now he fights for his own beliefs, his own form of justice, to escape this\n"
"never-ending cycle of cursed fate."
msgstr ""
"Чоловік переді мною — Хакумен, герой далекого минулого. Він стоїть\n"
"тут, вірний власним переконанням, щоб розірвати колесо долі, яке,\n"
"здавалося, ніколи не зміниться..."

#. Key: RCL3_008
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: でも……。
#. JA:   
msgctxt "RCL3_008"
msgid "Still..."
msgstr "Та все ж..."

#. Key: RCL3_009
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 何かがおかしい。
#. JA:   ズレているのだ。
msgctxt "RCL3_009"
msgid "Something is not right... Something has shifted."
msgstr "Щось не так. Щось змістилося."

#. Key: RCL3_010
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あの星がズレているのと同様に、
#. JA:   ここで起こるべき事象もまたズレている。
msgctxt "RCL3_010"
msgid "Just as the star has shifted, so has the course of the world."
msgstr "Як змістилася та зоря, так змістилися й події, що мали тут відбутися."

#. Key: RCL3_011
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私は最初、それがココノエの手によるものだと考えていた。
#. JA:   彼女が全てを知るがゆえに、この世界を変えようともがいていることを私は知っていたから。
msgctxt "RCL3_011"
msgid ""
"At first, I thought perhaps Kokonoe was responsible. After all, she is the closest to\n"
"uncovering the truth, and she knows of my efforts to change this cursed world."
msgstr ""
"Спершу я подумала, що це справа Коконое. Адже я знала: вона\n"
"намагається змінити цей світ, бо знає всю правду."

#. Key: RCL3_012
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私はココノエならばそれを為し得るかもしれないと思っていた。
#. JA:   けれど、違う。
msgctxt "RCL3_012"
msgid "I thought perhaps she would attempt...something. But this?"
msgstr "Я гадала, що Коконое, можливо, здатна це зробити. Та помилилася."

#. Key: RCL3_013
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: これはココノエの業<ruby>わざ</ruby>ではない。
#. JA:   彼女には、ここまで大きなズレを生み出す事はできない。
msgctxt "RCL3_013"
msgid "This is not Kokonoe's doing. She could never cause a shift of this magnitude."
msgstr "Це не її рук справа. Їй не під силу спричинити такий великий зсув."

#. Key: RCL3_014
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: だとしたら―――。
#. JA:   
msgctxt "RCL3_014"
msgid "Then, that would mean..."
msgstr "Якщо так..."

#. Key: RCL3_015
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: フフッ……。
msgctxt "RCL3_015"
msgid "Hehe..."
msgstr "Хі-хі..."

#. Key: RCL3_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 何故に嗤う？
msgctxt "RCL3_016"
msgid "You smile...why?"
msgstr "Чому смієшся?"

#. Key: RCL3_017
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いえ、少し遊んであげようかという気になっただけよ。
msgctxt "RCL3_017"
msgid "Well, I thought that, since I am here and so are you, perhaps we could play a little?"
msgstr "Просто подумала, що можна трохи з тобою погратися."

#. Key: RCL3_018
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……戯れ言を。
#. JA:   貴様は所詮“傍観者”。
#. JA:   何処となり、去るが良い。
msgctxt "RCL3_018"
msgid ""
"...Surely you jest. You are nothing more than a spectator.\n"
"You would be wise to take your leave."
msgstr "...Дурниці. Ти лише спостерігачка. Іди собі геть."

#. Key: RCL3_019
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方の方こそ、“観客”あっての“道化”だということが
#. JA:   理解できていないのではなくて？
msgctxt "RCL3_019"
msgid "Big words from a clown with no audience."
msgstr "А ти, здається, не розумієш, що блазень існує лише завдяки глядачам."

#. Key: RCL3_020
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: クククッ、道化とはな……。
msgctxt "RCL3_020"
msgid "Hahaha... A clown, eh?"
msgstr "Ха-ха-ха... Блазень, кажеш..."

#. Key: RCL3_022
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ならば、どちらが道化か……。
msgctxt "RCL3_022"
msgid "Let us see who between us is truly a clown."
msgstr "Тоді з'ясуймо, хто з нас блазень."

#. Key: RCL3_023
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ええ、すぐに分かることよ。
#. JA:   すぐにね。
msgctxt "RCL3_023"
msgid "Oh yes. Yes, let's do. I believe I would like that very much."
msgstr "Так, незабаром дізнаємося. Дуже скоро."

#. Key: RCL3_028
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様！　姫様！
#. JA:   しっかりするッス！
msgctxt "RCL3_028"
msgid ""
"Princess! Princess!\n"
"Get a grip!"
msgstr "Принцесо! Принцесо! Тримайтеся!"

#. Key: RCL3_029
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様ぁっ！
#. JA:   あんな奴さっさとやっちまってよ！
msgctxt "RCL3_029"
msgid "Princess! H-Hurry up and finish that guy off!"
msgstr "Принцесо! Мерщій розправтеся з ним!"

#. Key: RCL3_030
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……やはり道化は貴様であったな。
msgctxt "RCL3_030"
msgid "Hah! You show your true colors, jester!"
msgstr "...Тож блазень тут таки ти."

#. Key: RCL3_031
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: まさか……これも……“ズレ”だというの……？
msgctxt "RCL3_031"
msgid "Of all the— Is this, too, a shift?"
msgstr "Невже... це теж... зсув...?"

#. Key: RCL3_033
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……また会おう、彼の時代にて。
msgctxt "RCL3_033"
msgid "...Let us meet again, in -his- era."
msgstr "...Зустрінемося знову в його часі."

#. Key: RCL3_038
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 消えなさい。
#. JA:   貴方の出番はもうなくてよ。
msgctxt "RCL3_038"
msgid ""
"Begone, Harlequin! The stage grows tired of your wooden performance,\n"
"and your audience has long since departed."
msgstr "Зникни. Твоя роль уже скінчилася."

#. Key: RCL3_039
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Hakumen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: クゥっ、事象干渉か……！
#. JA:   貴様……！
msgctxt "RCL3_039"
msgid "Damnable intervention! A curse upon you, harlot!"
msgstr "Кх... Втручання у причинність...! Ти...!"

#. Key: RCL3_041
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL3_041"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL3_043
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL3_043"
msgid "...!"
msgstr "...!"

#. Key: RCL3_044
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 見守るしかないのね、また……。
msgctxt "RCL3_044"
msgid "It would seem that once again, all we can do is watch..."
msgstr "Мені знову лишається тільки спостерігати..."

#. Key: RCL3_045
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ひうっ……！
msgctxt "RCL3_045"
msgid "Aaah!"
msgstr "Гі-і!"

#. Key: RCL3_046
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ギィ！
#. JA:   いきなり変な声出すんじゃないよ！
msgctxt "RCL3_046"
msgid "Gii! You scared the living crap out of me!"
msgstr "Ґі! Не верещи раптом, я аж злякався!"

#. Key: RCL3_047
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: だだだだって……。
msgctxt "RCL3_047"
msgid "B-B-B-B-But...!"
msgstr "А-а-але ж..."

#. Key: RCL3_049
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: よう、「吸血鬼」。
msgctxt "RCL3_049"
msgid "Hey there, vampire."
msgstr "Здоров, вампірко."

#. Key: RCL3_050
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……なるほどね。
#. JA:   やっと理解できたわ。
msgctxt "RCL3_050"
msgid ""
"...Ah. I suppose I should have known. I never had much use for Mr. Occam, but\n"
"perhaps I was wrong..."
msgstr "...Зрозуміло. Тепер я нарешті збагнула."

#. Key: RCL3_051
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方がこんな表層に出てきているのだもの。
#. JA:   “ズレ”も生まれるわけね。
msgctxt "RCL3_051"
msgid ""
"If -you- are here, the shifts I've been forced to endure begin to make a modicum of\n"
"sense."
msgstr "Якщо ти вийшов аж сюди, на поверхню, не дивно, що виник зсув."

#. Key: RCL3_052
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: クソ吸血鬼にしちゃ理解が早いな。
#. JA:   ちっとはオベンキョーしたか？
msgctxt "RCL3_052"
msgid "You're pretty sharp for a shitty vampire, haha. Been doin' a little studying?"
msgstr "Як на кляту вампірку, ти швидко догнала. Трохи підучилася?"

#. Key: RCL3_053
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方の方は一度死んで少しはマシになるかと
#. JA:   思っていたのだけれど、その蛆虫面は変わらないのね。
msgctxt "RCL3_053"
msgid ""
"I thought perhaps death would humble you somewhat, but I now see that was a\n"
"foolish hope. You still have the complexion of a maggot and the face of a worm,\n"
"I see."
msgstr ""
"Я думала, що після смерті ти станеш хоч трохи кращим. Та твоє\n"
"хробачине обличчя так і не змінилося."

#. Key: RCL3_054
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ま、こんなナリでもいろいろ楽しみ方はあるもんでね……。
msgctxt "RCL3_054"
msgid "Well, there are lots of things I can do -because- I look like this..."
msgstr "Ну, навіть із такою зовнішністю можна знайти чимало розваг..."

#. Key: RCL3_055
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いっそのこと、虫ケラにでも転生したらどうなの？
#. JA:   その方がお似合いだと思うわ。
#. JA:   すぐに踏み潰してあげるけど。
msgctxt "RCL3_055"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you would enjoy being a bug? I don't mean to presume, but such an\n"
"appearance would suit you. I could take pleasure in stomping you!"
msgstr ""
"То може, вже переродишся на справжню комаху? Це тобі більше\n"
"личитиме. Я одразу тебе розчавлю."

#. Key: RCL3_056
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: おめーの悪口は単純すぎてムカつく気にもならねえよ……。
#. JA:   今度はそっちのオベンキョーもしといた方がいんじゃねーか？
msgctxt "RCL3_056"
msgid ""
"Your insults are so dull. I couldn't even get angry if I tried...\n"
"Maybe you should study up on how to insult your opponent?"
msgstr ""
"Твої образи такі примітивні, що навіть злості не викликають.\n"
"Наступного разу підучи й це."

#. Key: RCL3_057
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ぐっ……！
msgctxt "RCL3_057"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Кх...!"

#. Key: RCL3_058
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: クソ吸血鬼はのんびり“お紅茶”でも飲んでろってこった。
#. JA:   な？　分かる？　分かってる？　分かんねーよな、アホだから。
msgctxt "RCL3_058"
msgid ""
"You should just sit back and drink your little tea, stupid vampire.\n"
"Huh? Get it? Understand me? Haha. Probably not. You're a dumbass after all."
msgstr ""
"А тобі, клята вампірко, лишається спокійно пити свій чайочок.\n"
"Зрозуміла? Та де тобі, дурепі."

#. Key: RCL3_059
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: なっ……！
msgctxt "RCL3_059"
msgid "How dare you—"
msgstr "Що...!"

#. Key: RCL3_060
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: さーて、と……。
#. JA:   吸血鬼いじりにも飽きたし、別のとこ行くわ。
#. JA:   んじゃな。
msgctxt "RCL3_060"
msgid ""
"Oh man...I'm gettin' tired of picking on vampires, so I'm gonna head out.\n"
"See ya."
msgstr "Ну, гаразд... Набридло вже знущатися з вампірки. Піду деінде. Бувай."

#. Key: RCL3_062
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL3_062"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL3_063
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ひ、姫様……？
msgctxt "RCL3_063"
msgid "P-Princess?"
msgstr "П-принцесо...?"

#. Key: RCL3_064
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: だいじょうぶ、ッス、か……？
msgctxt "RCL3_064"
msgid "A-Are you OK...?"
msgstr "В-ви в порядку...?"

#. Key: RCL3_066
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はうっ！
msgctxt "RCL3_066"
msgid "Haouuu!"
msgstr "А-а!"

#. Key: RCL3_067
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL3_067"
msgid "Kuh!"
msgstr "Кх!"

#. Key: RCL3_068
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: この私に向かって……忌々しい！
msgctxt "RCL3_068"
msgid ""
"He would dare speak to me, to -me-, in such a way!?\n"
"Why, if I could get my hands around his vicious little neck—"
msgstr "Він насмілився так говорити зі мною... Яка зухвалість!"

#. Key: RCL3_070
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いぎぃっ!?
msgctxt "RCL3_070"
msgid "Eeeek!"
msgstr "Ґі-і?!"

#. Key: RCL3_071
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様！
#. JA:   落ち着くんだよ！
#. JA:   落ち着いて！
msgctxt "RCL3_071"
msgid "M-Milady! Calm down, please! Calm down!"
msgstr "Принцесо! Заспокойтеся! Спокійно!"

#. Key: RCL3_073
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そうッス……さすがにこれ以上は、おいら……。
msgctxt "RCL3_073"
msgid "I-I don't think I can take much more..."
msgstr "Так... Я більше не витримаю..."

#. Key: RCL3_074
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ハァ、ハァ、ハァ……。
msgctxt "RCL3_074"
msgid "Haah, haah, haah..."
msgstr "Ха... ха... ха..."

#. Key: RCL3_077
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……ふうっ。
msgctxt "RCL3_077"
msgid "Hahh..."
msgstr "...Фух."

#. Key: RCL3_078
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様、あいつ放っておいていいのかい？
#. JA:   またよからぬこと企んでるんじゃ……。
msgctxt "RCL3_078"
msgid "You sure you wanna leave that guy alone? He might be up to no good again..."
msgstr ""
"Принцесо, невже ти залишиш його в спокої? Він знову щось недобре\n"
"замислив..."

#. Key: RCL3_079
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL3_079"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL3_080
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あんな馬鹿に関わるだけ無駄ね。
msgctxt "RCL3_080"
msgid "Why should I waste my time on a charlatan like him?"
msgstr "Не варто марнувати час на такого дурня."

#. Key: RCL3_081
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 許しを乞わせてやるわ……。
msgctxt "RCL3_081"
msgid "Oh, I shall see that he receives his just desserts... But in due time."
msgstr "Я змушу його благати про прощення..."

#. Key: RCL3_085
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あんな馬鹿に関わるだけ無駄ね。
msgctxt "RCL3_085"
msgid "Why should I waste my time on a charlatan like him?"
msgstr "Не варто марнувати час на такого дурня."

#. Key: RCL3_086
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: だ、だったらそれでもいいんだけど……。
msgctxt "RCL3_086"
msgid "I-If that's the case, then I suppose it's OK..."
msgstr "Я-якщо ти так вважаєш, то гаразд..."

#. Key: RCL3_087
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いい？
#. JA:   私の前で二度とあいつの話をしないでちょうだい！
msgctxt "RCL3_087"
msgid ""
"I will say this only once. Do not speak of him in my presence, again. Ever.\n"
"There will be consequences."
msgstr "Слухайте уважно: більше ніколи не згадуйте його в моїй присутності!"

#. Key: RCL3_088
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: しないッス、絶対！
msgctxt "RCL3_088"
msgid "I won't... Ever..."
msgstr "Нізащо, обіцяю!"

#. Key: RCL3_089
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……姫様、誰か来るよ？
msgctxt "RCL3_089"
msgid "...Princess, somebody's coming!"
msgstr "...Принцесо, сюди хтось іде."

#. Key: RCL3_091
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 今度は、誰？
msgctxt "RCL3_091"
msgid "I grow tired of this. Who approaches?"
msgstr "Хто цього разу?"

#. Key: RCL3_093
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……あン？
msgctxt "RCL3_093"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Га?"

#. Key: RCL3_097
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 許しを乞わせてやるわ……。
msgctxt "RCL3_097"
msgid "Oh, the pain I will visit upon that man... I will see him beg for death."
msgstr "Я змушу його благати про прощення..."

#. Key: RCL3_098
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: でもあいつどこに行ったか分からないッスよ……？
msgctxt "RCL3_098"
msgid "But, we don't even know where he went..."
msgstr "Але ж ми не знаємо, куди він пішов..."

#. Key: RCL3_099
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ココノエのところに行くわ。
#. JA:   あいつは絶対にココノエに接触する。
msgctxt "RCL3_099"
msgid "We will find him with Kokonoe. I am loathe to admit it, but I know him."
msgstr "Підемо до Коконое. Він неодмінно зв'яжеться з нею."

#. Key: RCL3_100
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: じゃあ「第七機関」だね？
msgctxt "RCL3_100"
msgid "Then, we're going to Sector Seven, right?"
msgstr "Отже, до Сектору Сім?"

#. Key: RCL3_101
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ええ。
msgctxt "RCL3_101"
msgid "That is correct."
msgstr "Так."

#. Key: RCL3_102
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: もし、あいつがココノエのところに行かなかったとしても、
#. JA:   報せておかなくてはならないわ……。
msgctxt "RCL3_102"
msgid "If he has not yet gone to Kokonoe, then she must know of his imminent arrival."
msgstr "А навіть якщо він до Коконое не прийде, її треба попередити..."

#. Key: RCL4_001
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……なんでテメェがいるんだよ。
msgctxt "RCL4_001"
msgid "...Why the hell are you here?"
msgstr "...Якого біса ти тут робиш?"

#. Key: RCL4_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL4_002"
msgid "*giggle*"
msgstr "Хі-хі..."

#. Key: RCL4_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……てめっ！
msgctxt "RCL4_004"
msgid "...Damn you!"
msgstr "...Ах ти ж!"

#. Key: RCL4_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 相変わらず愚鈍の化身のような男ね。
msgctxt "RCL4_006"
msgid ""
"Is that all? Hah! Plato may have believed the Forms were incorporeal and atemporal,\n"
"but here you are before me: the Form of a fool!"
msgstr "Ти, як завжди, наче саме втілення тупості."

#. Key: RCL4_007
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: うるせえっ！
#. JA:   高みの見物決め込んでるテメェに言われたかねえ！
msgctxt "RCL4_007"
msgid "Shut up! I won't be insulted by someone kickin' back in the box seats!"
msgstr "Замовкни! Не тобі мене судити: ти лише збоку дивишся!"

#. Key: RCL4_008
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……およしなさいな。
#. JA:   貴方の目的は私じゃないのでしょう？
msgctxt "RCL4_008"
msgid ""
"...Such vicious accusations! Why the venom, Grim Reaper? I don't believe you're\n"
"after me."
msgstr "...Облиш. Твоя мета ж не я, хіба ні?"

#. Key: RCL4_009
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: テメェはマジで一回痛い目見ないと分かんねーみたいだな……！
msgctxt "RCL4_009"
msgid "Now you're just askin' for it...!"
msgstr "Схоже, ти не зрозумієш, поки сама не дістанеш прочухана!"

#. Key: RCL4_011
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……愚鈍。
msgctxt "RCL4_011"
msgid "...Fool."
msgstr "...Ідіот."

#. Key: RCL4_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……ハァ、ハァ。
msgctxt "RCL4_016"
msgid "*pant* *pant*"
msgstr "...Ха... ха..."

#. Key: RCL4_017
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あら、もう終り？
#. JA:   “痛い目”っていうものを見せてくれるのではなくて？
msgctxt "RCL4_017"
msgid "Oh my, finished so soon? Hmm... What was it I was <DQ>asking for<DQ> again?"
msgstr "О, це вже все? Ти ж обіцяв завдати мені «прочухана»."

#. Key: RCL4_018
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: うるせぇ馬鹿！
msgctxt "RCL4_018"
msgid "Shut up, stupid!"
msgstr "Замовкни, дурепо!"

#. Key: RCL4_020
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 駄目ね、貴方がこんな調子じゃ……。
msgctxt "RCL4_020"
msgid "This is pointless... In this state, you cannot possibly..."
msgstr "Кепсько. Якщо ти й далі такий..."

#. Key: RCL4_021
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ナゴ、ギィ。
#. JA:   帰るわよ……。
msgctxt "RCL4_021"
msgid "Nago, Gii, it's time we took our leave."
msgstr "Наґо, Ґі. Повертаємося додому..."

#. Key: RCL4_022
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: もういいのかい、姫様？
msgctxt "RCL4_022"
msgid "Are you sure, milady?"
msgstr "Уже все, принцесо?"

#. Key: RCL4_023
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ええ。少し疲れたわ。
msgctxt "RCL4_023"
msgid "Yes. Our petites vacances has exhausted me. I wish to return home."
msgstr "Так. Я трохи втомилася."

#. Key: RCL4_024
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ギィ、帰ったらお茶の準備をお願いね。
#. JA:   お茶受けも忘れないで。
msgctxt "RCL4_024"
msgid "Gii, I will be expecting hot tea soon after we return."
msgstr "Ґі, коли повернемося, приготуй чай. І не забудь чогось до чаю."

#. Key: RCL4_025
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 分かってるッス！
msgctxt "RCL4_025"
msgid "Got it!"
msgstr "Зрозумів!"

#. Key: RCL4_026
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: もう来るんじゃねーぞこのウサギが！
msgctxt "RCL4_026"
msgid "Don't ever come back, stupid rabbit!"
msgstr "І не повертайся більше, клята кролице!"

#. Key: RCL4_028
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL4_028"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL4_029
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……な、なんだよ？
msgctxt "RCL4_029"
msgid "...Wh-What?"
msgstr "...Щ-що?"

#. Key: RCL4_030
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 愚鈍。
msgctxt "RCL4_030"
msgid "Fool."
msgstr "Ідіот."

#. Key: RCL4_031
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: てめ、このっ……！
msgctxt "RCL4_031"
msgid "Why you...!"
msgstr "Ах ти ж...!"

#. Key: RCL4_033
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はあ……。無駄足だったわ……。
msgctxt "RCL4_033"
msgid "Hmph... What a waste of time..."
msgstr "Ха-а... Даремно сюди йшла..."

#. Key: RCL4_039
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: くそ……っ！
msgctxt "RCL4_039"
msgid "Dammit...!"
msgstr "Чорт...!"

#. Key: RCL4_040
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL4_040"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL4_042
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……なんだよ？
msgctxt "RCL4_042"
msgid "...What?"
msgstr "...Що?"

#. Key: RCL4_044
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いでっ！
msgctxt "RCL4_044"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr "Ай!"

#. Key: RCL4_045
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ひ、姫様が……。
msgctxt "RCL4_045"
msgid "T-The princess..."
msgstr "П-принцеса..."

#. Key: RCL4_046
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: グーで殴った、ッス……。
msgctxt "RCL4_046"
msgid "Hit him with a fist..."
msgstr "Вдарила його кулаком..."

#. Key: RCL4_047
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: てめえっ！
#. JA:   何しやが―――
msgctxt "RCL4_047"
msgid ""
"Why you...!\n"
"What the hell was—"
msgstr "Ах ти ж! Що ти..."

#. Key: RCL4_049
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL4_049"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL4_050
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: なぜ手加減なんかするの。
msgctxt "RCL4_050"
msgid "Why do you hold back?"
msgstr "Чому ти стримуєшся?"

#. Key: RCL4_051
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……あ？
msgctxt "RCL4_051"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Га?"

#. Key: RCL4_052
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: まだ分からないの？
#. JA:   こんなにも繰り返しておきながら！
msgctxt "RCL4_052"
msgid "You still don't understand? Even after so many repetitions!?"
msgstr "Ти досі не зрозумів? Після стількох повторень?!"

#. Key: RCL4_053
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方のその中途半端な甘さが
#. JA:   この世界を最悪の方向へと導いていることに、
#. JA:   どうして気付かないの？
msgctxt "RCL4_053"
msgid "Don't you see that your lack of conviction dooms this world to oblivion!?"
msgstr ""
"Чому ти не бачиш, що твоя половинчаста м'якість веде цей світ до\n"
"найгіршого кінця?"

#. Key: RCL4_054
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: お、おい、何言ってんだよ……。
#. JA:   ワケ分かんねーよ……。
msgctxt "RCL4_054"
msgid "H-Hey...what the heck are you talkin' about? I have no clue what's going on..."
msgstr "Е-ей, про що ти...? Нічого не розумію..."

#. Key: RCL4_055
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方は何のために戦っているの？
#. JA:   貴方は何のために生きているの？
#. JA:   貴方は何のために産まれ出たの？
msgctxt "RCL4_055"
msgid "Why are you fighting? Why are you living... Why were you born!?"
msgstr "Заради чого ти б'єшся? Заради чого живеш? Заради чого народився?"

#. Key: RCL4_056
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: この世界を壊すためなのでしょう？
#. JA:   この世界を止めるためなのでしょう？
msgctxt "RCL4_056"
msgid "You're here only to destroy the world, aren't you!? To end it all!?"
msgstr "Хіба не для того, щоб знищити цей світ? Щоб зупинити його?"

#. Key: RCL4_057
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 俺は、ただ……。
msgctxt "RCL4_057"
msgid "I was...just..."
msgstr "Я лише..."

#. Key: RCL4_059
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL4_059"
msgid "!?"
msgstr "?!"

#. Key: RCL4_060
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 時間ね、もう……。
msgctxt "RCL4_060"
msgid "*sigh* The time has already come..."
msgstr "Уже час..."

#. Key: RCL4_062
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ねえ……？
msgctxt "RCL4_062"
msgid "You..."
msgstr "Послухай..."

#. Key: RCL4_063
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: な、なんだよ急に。
#. JA:   気持ちわりぃぞ、ウサ―――
msgctxt "RCL4_063"
msgid "Wh-What's with you? You're creepin' me out, rabb—"
msgstr "Ч-що з тобою раптом? Аж моторошно, кро..."

#. Key: RCL4_064
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 茶化さないで聞いて……。
msgctxt "RCL4_064"
msgid "Not now. Listen to me."
msgstr "Не жартуй. Вислухай мене..."

#. Key: RCL4_065
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 絶対に諦めないで……！
#. JA:   最後の最後まで人として、ただの“人間”として足掻きなさい。
#. JA:   醜くてもいい、みっともなくてもいいから。
msgctxt "RCL4_065"
msgid ""
"Never admit defeat. Endure whatever pain you may face, and fight until your last\n"
"breath, as a human being. Even if you are ugly, and pathetic, and broken..."
msgstr ""
"Ніколи не здавайся...! До останнього чини опір як людина — просто\n"
"людина. Нехай це буде потворно й жалюгідно."

#. Key: RCL4_066
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: レイ……チェル……
msgctxt "RCL4_066"
msgid "Rachel..."
msgstr "Рей... чел..."

#. Key: RCL4_067
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 頑張って、ラグナ。
msgctxt "RCL4_067"
msgid "Please, Ragna."
msgstr "Тримайся, Раґно."

#. Key: RCL4_069
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL4_069"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL4_071
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 言われなくてもそうするっつーの。
msgctxt "RCL4_071"
msgid "That's what I was planning to do anyway."
msgstr "І без тебе так збирався."

#. Key: RCL4_073
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ちっ、精錬終了ってか……。
msgctxt "RCL4_073"
msgid "Tch, so this is the climax, huh...?"
msgstr "Тьху, виплавлення вже завершилося, чи що...?"

#. Key: RCL4_075
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: おら、かかってこいよ！！
msgctxt "RCL4_075"
msgid "All right, bring it on!"
msgstr "Ану, нападай!!"

#. Key: RCL5_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL5_002"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL5_003
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   私は、夢を見ている。
msgctxt "RCL5_003"
msgid ""
"\n"
"I am...dreaming."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Я бачу сон."

#. Key: RCL5_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   ずっと続く、長い長い夢。
#. JA:   終わりのない夢。
msgctxt "RCL5_004"
msgid ""
"\n"
"A terribly long dream...one with no end."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Довгий-довгий сон, що триває без кінця."

#. Key: RCL5_005
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   夢から醒めようと必死で足掻いても、抜け出せない。
#. JA:   私はもはや諦めかけていた。
msgctxt "RCL5_005"
msgid ""
"\n"
"It matters not how I struggle to wake myself from the dream. It is futile.\n"
"Perhaps...it is time to give up..."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Хоч як відчайдушно намагаюся прокинутися, з цього сну не вирватися.\n"
"Я вже майже здалася."

#. Key: RCL5_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   この終わりのない夢からの脱出を。
msgctxt "RCL5_006"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Give up, and forget about life outside this dream..."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Майже відмовилася від думки покинути цей нескінченний сон."

#. Key: RCL5_008
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 「……また、駄目だったのね」
msgctxt "RCL5_008"
msgid "It would appear I have failed, once again."
msgstr "...Знову не вийшло."

#. Key: RCL5_010
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   「何度目かしら……ここを歩くのは」
msgctxt "RCL5_010"
msgid ""
"\n"
"How many times have I been here...in this very spot."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Скільки разів я вже йшла цим місцем...?"

#. Key: RCL5_011
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   そう……ここは覚める事のない夢の入り口。
#. JA:   果てのない回廊への扉。
msgctxt "RCL5_011"
msgid ""
"\n"
"The entrance to the dream from which I can never wake...\n"
"The doors of the abyss..."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Так... Це початок сну, з якого не прокинутися. Двері до безкінечного\n"
"коридору."

#. Key: RCL5_012
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   私はまた、この場所に戻ってきた。
#. JA:   いつものように……。
msgctxt "RCL5_012"
msgid ""
"\n"
"And here I am. Again.\n"
"Everything the way it was..."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Я знову повернулася сюди. Як завжди..."

#. Key: RCL5_013
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 「―――チェル」
msgctxt "RCL5_013"
msgid "...chel..."
msgstr "...йчел."

#. Key: RCL5_014
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 「声……？」
msgctxt "RCL5_014"
msgid "...A voice!?"
msgstr "Голос...?"

#. Key: RCL5_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   この声は……。
msgctxt "RCL5_016"
msgid ""
"\n"
"This...this voice..."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Цей голос..."

#. Key: RCL5_017
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 「レイチェル……」
msgctxt "RCL5_017"
msgid "Rachel..."
msgstr "Рейчел..."

#. Key: RCL5_018
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Unknown on screen; internally Ragna
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   
#. JA:   「わりぃな……ありがとよ……」
msgctxt "RCL5_018"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Sorry...and thanks..."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"Пробач... і дякую..."

#. Key: RCL5_020
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 「う、ん……」
msgctxt "RCL5_020"
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr "Так..."

#. Key: RCL5_022
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: お目覚めでございますか、レイチェル様。
msgctxt "RCL5_022"
msgid "Are you awake, milady?"
msgstr "Ви вже прокинулися, пані Рейчел?"

#. Key: RCL5_023
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……ええ。
#. JA:   今日はなんだか、寝覚めが良いわ。
msgctxt "RCL5_023"
msgid "...Yes. In fact, I feel quite refreshed. "
msgstr "...Так. Сьогодні я чомусь прокинулася з гарним настроєм."

#. Key: RCL5_024
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 左様でございますか。
msgctxt "RCL5_024"
msgid "Do you indeed?"
msgstr "Справді?"

#. Key: RCL5_025
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それでは、そのご機嫌を損なわぬよう、
#. JA:   最高の紅茶をお淹れ致しましょう。
msgctxt "RCL5_025"
msgid ""
"In that case, I shall prepare the most exquisite tea before you have returned to your\n"
"customary foul temper."
msgstr "Тоді заварю найкращий чай, щоб цей настрій не зіпсувався."

#. Key: RCL5_026
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……そうね。だったら中庭で頂くわ。
#. JA:   先に行くから持って来てちょうだい。
msgctxt "RCL5_026"
msgid ""
"...An excellent idea, Valkenhayn. Would you be so kind as to bring it to me in the\n"
"courtyard? I shall be waiting."
msgstr "...Добре. Я вип'ю його у дворі. Принеси туди, я піду першою."

#. Key: RCL5_027
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 畏まりました。
msgctxt "RCL5_027"
msgid "Of course, madam."
msgstr "Як накажете."

#. Key: RCL5_030
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 今夜は、月が綺麗ね……。
msgctxt "RCL5_030"
msgid "The moon...is quite beautiful tonight."
msgstr "Сьогодні місяць такий гарний..."

#. Key: RCL6_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: キャッ！
msgctxt "RCL6_002"
msgid "Kyah!"
msgstr "Ай!"

#. Key: RCL6_003
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: おうっ！
msgctxt "RCL6_003"
msgid "Oogh!"
msgstr "Ух!"

#. Key: RCL6_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: なに、ここは……？
msgctxt "RCL6_004"
msgid "Oh dear... What is this place?"
msgstr "Що це за місце...?"

#. Key: RCL6_005
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 転移失敗ッスね……。
msgctxt "RCL6_005"
msgid "Looks like we messed up..."
msgstr "Перенесення не вдалося..."

#. Key: RCL6_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: まったく……。余計なモノがくっ付いてきたからだわ。
#. JA:   だからガサツな男は嫌いなのよ……。
msgctxt "RCL6_006"
msgid ""
"Oh dear... it would seem we are not where we should be...\n"
"You disgust me."
msgstr ""
"І все через те, що до нас причепилося щось зайве. Тому я й не люблю\n"
"грубих чоловіків..."

#. Key: RCL6_007
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ホント、嫌になるわっ！
msgctxt "RCL6_007"
msgid "Oh, puhlease!"
msgstr "Ото вже правда!"

#. Key: RCL6_008
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ん？
#. JA:   拙者はなぜにこのような場所に……？
msgctxt "RCL6_008"
msgid "Hm? What am I doing here...?"
msgstr "Га? Чому я тут опинився...?"

#. Key: RCL6_010
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: もしや……これが噂に聞く「わーぷ」でござるか！
msgctxt "RCL6_010"
msgid "Could this be...the <DQ>warp<DQ> I've heard about!?"
msgstr "Невже це той самий «телепорт», про який я чув?!"

#. Key: RCL6_011
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 拙者が厳しい修行の末に身に付けた空<ruby>うつ</ruby>蝉<ruby>せみ</ruby>とは違う……。
#. JA:   よもや本当の空間移動を体感できようとは、
#. JA:   いやはや、正直感服せざるを得ぬ……。
msgctxt "RCL6_011"
msgid ""
"In my years of rigorous training, I never would've imagined I would get to see this\n"
"day... To experience a space-time jump with my very own eyes..."
msgstr ""
"Це не схоже на підміну тіла, якої я навчився за роки суворих тренувань...\n"
"Подумати лишень: мені довелося відчути справжнє перенесення в\n"
"просторі! Не можу не захоплюватися..."

#. Key: RCL6_013
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はわっ!?
msgctxt "RCL6_013"
msgid "Huwah!?"
msgstr "А?!"

#. Key: RCL6_014
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ま、まさかこのように高等な術を使いこなすお主は
#. JA:   最高クラスの「咎追い」ではッ!?
msgctxt "RCL6_014"
msgid "D-Don't tell me...are you the one who did this!? Could you be...a top-class vigilante!?"
msgstr ""
"Н-невже ти, здатна на таке складне мистецтво, — мисливиця за\n"
"головами найвищого класу?!"

#. Key: RCL6_015
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いやしかしこのような子供が達人などとは
#. JA:   ちとあり得ぬ話……。いやいやしかし、
#. JA:   見かけで物事を判断してはいかんと殿も常々……
msgctxt "RCL6_015"
msgid ""
"It is almost unbelievable that a small child, such as yourself, can be a true master\n"
"of the art... However, the saying does go, don't judge a book by its cover..."
msgstr ""
"Але ж дитина не може бути такою майстринею... Хоча мій володар\n"
"завжди казав: не суди за зовнішністю..."

#. Key: RCL6_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ではまさか達人の御子息かッ!?
msgctxt "RCL6_016"
msgid "Then...could she be the descendant of a master!?"
msgstr "То, може, ти дитина справжнього майстра?!"

#. Key: RCL6_017
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あり得る！
#. JA:   英才教育を施された「えりーと」ならば高度な術を使えても
#. JA:   不思議はないッ！
msgctxt "RCL6_017"
msgid ""
"It's possible! If she's been trained by masters from a young age,\n"
"then it's entirely possible!"
msgstr ""
"Цілком можливо! Якщо змалку дістала належний вишкіл, не дивно, що\n"
"володіє таким високим мистецтвом!"

#. Key: RCL6_019
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あー、コホン。
msgctxt "RCL6_019"
msgid "Uhh... *ahem*"
msgstr "Е-е... Кхе-кхе."

#. Key: RCL6_021
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……あら、まだいたの？
msgctxt "RCL6_021"
msgid "...Oh. I suppose your departure was too much to hope for."
msgstr "...О, ти ще тут?"

#. Key: RCL6_022
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いやいや、先ほどは失礼つかまつった。
#. JA:   拙者、まさかお主が斯様にやんごとなきお方とは
#. JA:   思わなかったゆえ……。
msgctxt "RCL6_022"
msgid ""
"I humbly apologize for my impudence earlier. Although I was unaware of who you\n"
"were, my attitude was inexcusable..."
msgstr ""
"Пробач за мою попередню грубість. Я й гадки не мав, що ти така\n"
"поважна особа..."

#. Key: RCL6_023
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ギィ、おかわりを。
msgctxt "RCL6_023"
msgid "Gii, I require more crumpets."
msgstr "Ґі, налий мені ще."

#. Key: RCL6_024
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はいッス。
msgctxt "RCL6_024"
msgid "Roger that!"
msgstr "Так!"

#. Key: RCL6_025
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: んー……。絶好の昼寝日和だねぇ……。
msgctxt "RCL6_025"
msgid "Hmm... The perfect atmosphere for a nap, no?"
msgstr "О-о... Ідеальна днина для дрімоти..."

#. Key: RCL6_026
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: しかしながらお主が拙者の後輩にしようとしていた仕打ちは
#. JA:   如何なものか、と思う次第でござる。
msgctxt "RCL6_026"
msgid "But I must question what you were doing to my cute little disciple."
msgstr ""
"І все ж я маю сказати: з моїм молодшим поплічником ти повелася\n"
"негідно."

#. Key: RCL6_027
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 確かに、お主の気に障るようなことをしたかもしれぬ！
#. JA:   しかしそれは未熟ゆえであって邪心からではない！
#. JA:   拙者はそう信じたい！
msgctxt "RCL6_027"
msgid ""
"Perhaps he insulted you in some manner? Nonetheless, that could be a youthful\n"
"mistake, and it was by no means his true intent... That is what I would like to believe."
msgstr ""
"Може, він і зробив щось тобі неприємне. Але то від незрілості, а не зі\n"
"злого наміру! Принаймні я хочу в це вірити!"

#. Key: RCL6_029
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ギィ、もうちょっと鏡を上に向けて。
msgctxt "RCL6_029"
msgid "Gii, would you be so kind as to adjust the mirror upward?"
msgstr "Ґі, підніми дзеркало трохи вище."

#. Key: RCL6_030
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はいッス。
msgctxt "RCL6_030"
msgid "You said it."
msgstr "Так."

#. Key: RCL6_031
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……上げすぎ。
msgctxt "RCL6_031"
msgid "...Too high."
msgstr "...Занадто високо."

#. Key: RCL6_032
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: す、すみませんッス。
msgctxt "RCL6_032"
msgid "S-Sorry..."
msgstr "В-вибачте."

#. Key: RCL6_033
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 後でお仕置きよ。
msgctxt "RCL6_033"
msgid "I'm afraid that is insufficient. Your punishment will be forthcoming."
msgstr "Потім покараю тебе."

#. Key: RCL6_034
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: き、厳しいッス……。
msgctxt "RCL6_034"
msgid "Th-That's too much..."
msgstr "Я-як суворо..."

#. Key: RCL6_035
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: で、あるからして、いかに高貴な家に生まれ落ちようとも、
#. JA:   いかに英才教育を受けようとも、
#. JA:   それで人を見下してはならんわけでござる。
msgctxt "RCL6_035"
msgid ""
"Which is why, no matter how good of an education you receive, or how well off your\n"
"family is, you cannot look down on others."
msgstr ""
"Отже, хоч би яким знатним було твоє походження і хоч би яким добрим\n"
"був твій вишкіл, це не дає права дивитися на інших згори."

#. Key: RCL6_036
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ましてお主もカルル殿も子供同士ではないか。
#. JA:   であれば、そこに身分の上下などなく、気に入らぬことが
#. JA:   あったとしても喧嘩で済ませば良いのでござる。
msgctxt "RCL6_036"
msgid ""
"Not to mention, both you and Carl are but children.\n"
"You must not resolve your differences with your fists."
msgstr ""
"До того ж ви обоє з Карлом — діти. Тут не має бути вищих і нижчих за\n"
"станом. Якщо щось не до вподоби, посваріться й розберіться між собою."

#. Key: RCL6_038
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様！　痛いッス！
#. JA:   それ以上は駄目ッス！　無理ッス～！
msgctxt "RCL6_038"
msgid "Milady, it hurts! It hurts! No more, please... Aaaahhh!"
msgstr "Принцесо! Боляче! Більше не треба, не витримаю!"

#. Key: RCL6_039
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL6_039"
msgid "Zzz..."
msgstr "Хр-р..."

#. Key: RCL6_040
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: というわけでござる。
#. JA:   ……分かってくれたでござるか。
msgctxt "RCL6_040"
msgid ""
"And that's the case.\n"
"...Do you understand now?"
msgstr "Отак воно й є. ...Ти зрозуміла?"

#. Key: RCL6_041
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL6_041"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL6_042
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私は考えていた。
msgctxt "RCL6_042"
msgid "I take a moment to consider what the creature has said."
msgstr "Я замислилася."

#. Key: RCL6_043
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: この男もまたアークエネミーを所有していたはず……。
msgctxt "RCL6_043"
msgid "If I remember correctly, this man too carries a Nox Nyctores."
msgstr "Здається, цей чоловік теж володіє Арк-Енемі..."

#. Key: RCL6_044
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: どうでもいい男と思い、話も聞き流していたのだけれど、
#. JA:   仮にもアークエネミーに選ばれた者である以上、
#. JA:   この男もまた“出演者”なのだ。
msgctxt "RCL6_044"
msgid ""
"I would very much like to simply ignore the pestilent creature in front of me\n"
"and attend to other, more important, matters, but if he was chosen by a Nox-class\n"
"weapon... Then, he too, must have an important role in this play."
msgstr ""
"Я вважала його неважливим і не слухала, що він верзе. Але якщо\n"
"Арк-Енемі обрала його, значить, і він — один з учасників вистави."

#. Key: RCL6_045
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……貴方。
msgctxt "RCL6_045"
msgid "...You."
msgstr "...Ти."

#. Key: RCL6_046
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……なんでござるか。
msgctxt "RCL6_046"
msgid "...What is it?"
msgstr "...Що?"

#. Key: RCL6_047
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: やっぱり少し試させてもらうわ。
msgctxt "RCL6_047"
msgid "Then again..."
msgstr "Усе-таки я трохи тебе випробую."

#. Key: RCL6_048
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……ハァ？
msgctxt "RCL6_048"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr "...Га?"

#. Key: RCL6_052
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 見たか！
#. JA:   これぞ、「シシガミ忍法」！
msgctxt "RCL6_052"
msgid ""
"Did you see that!?\n"
"Now, this is the <DQ>Shishigami Ninpo<DQ>!"
msgstr "Бачила?! Ось воно — «мистецтво нінджя Шішіґамі»!"

#. Key: RCL6_053
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: こ、こんな知性の欠片もなさそうなむさい男に……。
#. JA:   この私が……。
msgctxt "RCL6_053"
msgid "To think I could be defeated by this...this...oaf! Of all the—"
msgstr "Мене... переміг цей незграбний чолов'яга без крихти розуму..."

#. Key: RCL6_054
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ナゴ、ギィ！
#. JA:   帰るわよ。
msgctxt "RCL6_054"
msgid "Nago, Gii, it is far past time we left!"
msgstr "Наґо, Ґі! Повертаємося."

#. Key: RCL6_055
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はいよ！
msgctxt "RCL6_055"
msgid "Roger that!"
msgstr "Так!"

#. Key: RCL6_056
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ギィ、帰ったらすぐにお風呂の準備をして頂戴。
#. JA:   全部洗い流したいわ。
msgctxt "RCL6_056"
msgid ""
"Gii! Prepare a bath! That filthy man touched me, and I fear he may have left\n"
"something of himself behind. I feel unclean!"
msgstr "Ґі, щойно повернемося, приготуй мені ванну. Хочу все змити."

#. Key: RCL6_057
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: は、はいッス！
msgctxt "RCL6_057"
msgid "O-Of course, milady."
msgstr "Т-так!"

#. Key: RCL6_059
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……さすが達人の御子息よ。
#. JA:   移動にもあのような乗り物を用いるとはのう……。
msgctxt "RCL6_059"
msgid ""
"...Nothing less from the heir to a master.\n"
"To be using such a strange technique... "
msgstr ""
"...Гідна спадкоємиця великого майстра. Навіть для пересування\n"
"використовує такий незвичайний засіб..."

#. Key: RCL6_063
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: むうっ……無念……っ！
msgctxt "RCL6_063"
msgid "Oogh... I have...no regrets...!"
msgstr "Кх... Яка прикрість...!"

#. Key: RCL6_065
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……ま、こんな知性の欠片もないむさい男じゃ
#. JA:   こんなものでしょうね。
#. JA:   期待した私が馬鹿だったわ。
msgctxt "RCL6_065"
msgid ""
"The only dangerous thing about you is your prodigious stench. Any fool armed with\n"
"so much as a clothespin would have little trouble defeating you."
msgstr ""
"...Ну, від такого неотесаного чолов'яги без крихти розуму годі було\n"
"чекати більшого. Даремно я на нього сподівалася."

#. Key: RCL6_066
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ナゴ、ギィ、行きましょう。
msgctxt "RCL6_066"
msgid "Nago, Gii, let us take our leave of this disgusting spectacle."
msgstr "Наґо, Ґі, ходімо."

#. Key: RCL6_067
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はーい、っと。
msgctxt "RCL6_067"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr "Добре."

#. Key: RCL6_068
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様、次はどこに行くッスか？
msgctxt "RCL6_068"
msgid "Milady, where are you goin'!?"
msgstr "Принцесо, куди тепер?"

#. Key: RCL6_069
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そうね、今度は―――
msgctxt "RCL6_069"
msgid "Let's see..."
msgstr "Що ж, цього разу..."

#. Key: RCL6_072
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Bang
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: う……ん。
#. JA:   ライチ殿……ここは、拙者が……。
msgctxt "RCL6_072"
msgid ""
"Oogh...ugh...\n"
"Miss Litchi...let me...handle this one..."
msgstr "У-у... Пані Лічі... Тут я сам..."

#. Key: RCL7_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……転移先が安定しないわ。
#. JA:   どうも“ズレ”が大きすぎるみたいね……。
msgctxt "RCL7_002"
msgid ""
"...Oh dear. It would seem we are not where we should be.\n"
"Perhaps it is due to this strange interference..."
msgstr "...Місце перенесення нестабільне. Схоже, зсув завеликий..."

#. Key: RCL7_003
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様、どうするんだい？
msgctxt "RCL7_003"
msgid "Princess, what are we gonna do?"
msgstr "Принцесо, що робитимемо?"

#. Key: RCL7_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: こうなると急いでも仕方がないわ。
#. JA:   お茶にしましょう。
msgctxt "RCL7_004"
msgid ""
"For the moment, I'm afraid there is little we can do, except take this opportunity\n"
"to enjoy a cup of tea."
msgstr "Тепер поспіх нічого не дасть. Вип'ємо чаю."

#. Key: RCL7_005
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はいよ！　ギィ！
#. JA:   姫様がお茶をご所望だよ！
msgctxt "RCL7_005"
msgid ""
"Sounds good!\n"
"Gii! The princess has requested a cup of tea."
msgstr "Добре! Ґі! Принцеса хоче чаю!"

#. Key: RCL7_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL7_006"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL7_007
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ギィ？
msgctxt "RCL7_007"
msgid "Gii?"
msgstr "Ґі?"

#. Key: RCL7_009
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ここッス……ここッス～！
msgctxt "RCL7_009"
msgid "Here! Right here!"
msgstr "Я тут... Тут я!"

#. Key: RCL7_010
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL7_010"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL7_012
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: な、なんだいアイツ！
msgctxt "RCL7_012"
msgid "Wh-What is that thing!?"
msgstr "Щ-що це за потвора?!"

#. Key: RCL7_013
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……低俗な物の怪よ。
#. JA:   不潔だからあまり近付かないようにしていたのだけれど……。
msgctxt "RCL7_013"
msgid "...A vulgar creature of lower orders. It is rather filthy. Take care not to touch it."
msgstr "...Ниций нечистий дух. Я уникала його через бруд..."

#. Key: RCL7_014
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様ッ！
#. JA:   助けてッス！
#. JA:   食べられ―――。
msgctxt "RCL7_014"
msgid ""
"Princess!\n"
"Help me, please!\n"
"I'm getting eaten—"
msgstr "Принцесо! Допоможіть! Мене їдять..."

#. Key: RCL7_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: た、食べた!?
msgctxt "RCL7_016"
msgid "H-He ate 'im?"
msgstr "Він його з-з'їв?!"

#. Key: RCL7_017
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あ　りうまく　ない　。
#. JA:   捕食　　なら　はり主の　か。
msgctxt "RCL7_017"
msgid "Does    tas      all.   shou   eat     master  nstead..."
msgstr "Не ду е сма но. Краще   з'їсти його госпо арку."

#. Key: RCL7_017a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あまりうまくはないな。
#. JA:   捕食するならやはり主の方か。
msgctxt "RCL7_017a"
msgid "Doesn't taste at all. I should eat the master instead..."
msgstr "Не дуже смачно. Краще вже з'їсти його господарку."

#. Key: RCL7_019
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: びめざまっ！
#. JA:   ぐらいッス！
#. JA:   ごばいッス！
msgctxt "RCL7_019"
msgid ""
"Princess!\n"
"It's dark in here!\n"
"I'm scared!"
msgstr "Принцесо! Тут темно! Страшно!"

#. Key: RCL7_021
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……仕方がないわね。
#. JA:   お茶が飲めないのも困りものだし……。
msgctxt "RCL7_021"
msgid ""
"...It would appear I have little choice.\n"
"I require my tea slave. You will return him to me."
msgstr "...Нічого не вдієш. Без нього я не зможу пити чай..."

#. Key: RCL7_022
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 奪い　け　ば戦　がい　。
#. JA:   ワ　は貴様　　には負け　が　。
msgctxt "RCL7_022"
msgid ""
"If  ou wan     back, then you      figh .\n"
"Thou  ,   doubt     stand   chance  gain   me."
msgstr "Хочеш    забра и — бийся. Але мені  не супер ик."

#. Key: RCL7_022a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 奪いたければ戦うがいい。
#. JA:   ワレは貴様などには負けぬがね。
msgctxt "RCL7_022a"
msgid ""
"If you want it back, then you must fight.\n"
"Though, I doubt you stand a chance against me."
msgstr "Хочеш його забрати — бийся. Але мені ти не суперник."

#. Key: RCL7_023
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: まずはその耳障りな口から黙らせましょうか。
msgctxt "RCL7_023"
msgid "Oh dear. We <I>will</I> have to do something about that insolent tone of yours."
msgstr "Я <I>таки</I> змушу замовкнути твій огидний рот."

#. Key: RCL7_028
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……転移先が安定しないわ。
#. JA:   どうも“ズレ”が大きすぎるみたいね……。
msgctxt "RCL7_028"
msgid ""
"...Oh dear. It would seem we are not where we should be.\n"
"Perhaps it is due to this strange interference..."
msgstr "...Місце перенесення нестабільне. Схоже, зсув завеликий..."

#. Key: RCL7_029
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様、どうするんだい？
msgctxt "RCL7_029"
msgid "Princess, what are we gonna do?"
msgstr "Принцесо, що робитимемо?"

#. Key: RCL7_030
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: こうなると急いでも仕方がないわ。
#. JA:   お茶にしましょう。
msgctxt "RCL7_030"
msgid ""
"For the moment, I'm afraid there is little we can do, except take this opportunity\n"
"to enjoy a cup of tea."
msgstr "Тепер поспіх нічого не дасть. Вип'ємо чаю."

#. Key: RCL7_031
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: はいよ！　ギィ！
#. JA:   姫様がお茶をご所望だよ！
msgctxt "RCL7_031"
msgid ""
"Sounds good!\n"
"Gii! The princess has requested a cup of tea."
msgstr "Добре! Ґі! Принцеса хоче чаю!"

#. Key: RCL7_032
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL7_032"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL7_033
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ギィ？
msgctxt "RCL7_033"
msgid "Gii?"
msgstr "Ґі?"

#. Key: RCL7_035
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ここッス……ここッス～！
msgctxt "RCL7_035"
msgid ""
"Here! \n"
"I'm right here!"
msgstr "Я тут... Тут я!"

#. Key: RCL7_036
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL7_036"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL7_038
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: な、なんだいアイツ！
msgctxt "RCL7_038"
msgid "Wh-What is that thing!?"
msgstr "Щ-що це за потвора?!"

#. Key: RCL7_039
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……低俗な物の怪よ。
#. JA:   不潔だからあまり近付かないようにしていたのだけれど……。
msgctxt "RCL7_039"
msgid "...A vulgar creature of lower orders. It is rather filthy. Take care not to touch it."
msgstr "...Ниций нечистий дух. Я уникала його через бруд..."

#. Key: RCL7_040
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 姫様ッ！
#. JA:   助けてッス！
#. JA:   食べられ―――。
msgctxt "RCL7_040"
msgid ""
"Princess!\n"
"Help me, please!\n"
"I'm getting eaten—"
msgstr "Принцесо! Допоможіть! Мене їдять..."

#. Key: RCL7_042
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: た、食べた!?
msgctxt "RCL7_042"
msgid "H-he ate 'im?"
msgstr "Він його з-з'їв?!"

#. Key: RCL7_043
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あ　りうまく　ない　。
#. JA:   捕食　　なら　はり主の　か。
msgctxt "RCL7_043"
msgid "Does    tas   at    .   shou   eat     master  nstead..."
msgstr "Не ду е сма но. Краще   з'їсти його госпо арку."

#. Key: RCL7_043a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: あまりうまくはないな。
#. JA:   捕食するならやはり主の方か。
msgctxt "RCL7_043a"
msgid "Doesn't taste at all. I should eat the master instead..."
msgstr "Не дуже смачно. Краще вже з'їсти його господарку."

#. Key: RCL7_045
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: うう……べたべたッス……。
msgctxt "RCL7_045"
msgid "Uhh...I'm all sticky..."
msgstr "У-у... Я весь липкий..."

#. Key: RCL7_047
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 汚らわしい蟲ね。
#. JA:   私の使い魔を汚すとは……非礼にもほどがあるわ。
msgctxt "RCL7_047"
msgid ""
"What a filthy insect. You have defiled my familiar. Must I show you your proper\n"
"place?"
msgstr ""
"Мерзенна комахо. Ти забруднила мого фамільяра... Оце вже нечувана\n"
"зухвалість."

#. Key: RCL7_049
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 　レは貴様　と　を恐れ　。
#. JA:   ワ　　気に　　ぬと　うなら　かってくれ　いい。
msgctxt "RCL7_049"
msgid "I do no  fear    , bu     you ha     prob    wi     ,    n I sha   indul   you."
msgstr "Я    не боюся. Не подо ається — напа ай."

#. Key: RCL7_049a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ワレは貴様ごときを恐れぬ。
#. JA:   ワレが気に入らぬというならかかってくればいい。
msgctxt "RCL7_049a"
msgid "I do not fear you, but if you have a problem with me, then I shall indulge you."
msgstr "Я тебе не боюся. Не подобається — нападай."

#. Key: RCL7_050
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 蟲に躾をするほど無意味な事もないけれど……。
msgctxt "RCL7_050"
msgid "Your hubris suggests a resistance to discipline, insect..."
msgstr "Немає нічого безглуздішого, ніж виховувати комаху..."

#. Key: RCL7_051
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 少しその口を閉じさせるくらいはいいかもしれないわね。
msgctxt "RCL7_051"
msgid "Nevertheless, perhaps I will manage to teach you some manners..."
msgstr "Але, можливо, варто змусити тебе трохи помовчати."

#. Key: RCL7_056
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: この力……。
#. JA:   まさかここにも“ズレ”が……!?
msgctxt "RCL7_056"
msgid "This power...! Has there been a shift here as well!?"
msgstr "Ця сила... Невже й тут стався зсув?!"

#. Key: RCL7_057
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いた　き　す。
msgctxt "RCL7_057"
msgid "Bon a   étit."
msgstr "Сма ного."

#. Key: RCL7_057a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いただきます。
msgctxt "RCL7_057a"
msgid "Bon appétit."
msgstr "Смачного."

#. Key: RCL7_064
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 嫌だ嫌　嫌　　だ死　のは嫌　蒼　　に入れ　まで死　た　　い
#. JA:   蒼　　しい蒼　　す蒼が必　な　だ僕　は……。
msgctxt "RCL7_064"
msgid ""
"No n  no   !   don   wan     die...!   need     pow       th  zure...!   need i ...\n"
"  need it,   need it...!"
msgstr ""
"Ні, ні,  ! Не хочу помирати! Не хочу поми ати, поки не здобуду Лаз р!\n"
"Я    Лазур, шукаю Лазур, Лазур мені потрі на..."

#. Key: RCL7_064a
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Arakune
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 嫌だ嫌だ嫌だ嫌だ死ぬのは嫌だ蒼を手に入れるまで死にたくない
#. JA:   蒼が欲しい蒼を探す蒼が必要なんだ僕には……。
msgctxt "RCL7_064a"
msgid ""
"No no no no! I don't want to die...! I need the power of the Azure...! I need it...\n"
"I need it, I need it...!"
msgstr ""
"Ні, ні, ні! Не хочу помирати! Не хочу помирати, поки не здобуду Лазур! Я\n"
"хочу Лазур, шукаю Лазур, Лазур мені потрібна..."

#. Key: RCL7_065
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 逃げるつもりみたいだよ。
#. JA:   姫様、放っておいていいのかい？
msgctxt "RCL7_065"
msgid "Looks like he's trying to run. Princess, are you just gonna let him go?"
msgstr "Схоже, він збирається втекти. Принцесо, відпустимо?"

#. Key: RCL7_066
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 構わないわ。
#. JA:   あんな蟲とこれ以上関わりたくないもの。
msgctxt "RCL7_066"
msgid ""
"I care not. I do not wish to be in the company of that...thing any longer than is\n"
"absolutely necessary."
msgstr "Так. Не хочу більше мати справу з цією комахою."

#. Key: RCL7_067
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: オイラももうべとべとはゴメンッス……。
msgctxt "RCL7_067"
msgid "I'm still trying to overcome my trauma..."
msgstr "І я більше не хочу бути липким..."

#. Key: RCL7_068
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ギィ、私から５メートル以上離れなさい。
#. JA:   ちゃんと身体を洗うまで私に近付かないで。
msgctxt "RCL7_068"
msgid ""
"Gii, you will remain at least five yards from me at all times until you have been\n"
"cleansed of that filth. Perhaps you should remain downwind as well. Should I catch\n"
"a whiff of your odious coating...I believe you know what will follow."
msgstr ""
"Ґі, тримайся від мене щонайменше за п'ять метрів. Не наближайся, поки\n"
"не помиєшся."

#. Key: RCL7_069
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: うっ……。
msgctxt "RCL7_069"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "Ух..."

#. Key: RCL7_070
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Nago
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: もちろんあたいにもね！
msgctxt "RCL7_070"
msgid "And that goes for me too!"
msgstr "І від мене теж!"

#. Key: RCL7_071
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Gii
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: みんな、冷たいッス……。
msgctxt "RCL7_071"
msgid "Everyone's so...cold..."
msgstr "Ви всі такі жорстокі..."

#. Key: RCL7_072
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL7_072"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL7_073
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: これ以上先へと進む事に、私は気後れしていた。
msgctxt "RCL7_073"
msgid "I have developed reservations in regards to pressing forward."
msgstr "Я вагалася, чи варто йти далі."

#. Key: RCL7_074
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: もはや生み出された“ズレ”はあまりに大きく、
#. JA:   この世界は私が望む崩壊を得る事はないだろう。
#. JA:   
msgctxt "RCL7_074"
msgid ""
"The shifts I have seen are far too great, and I fear it is too late for the resolution\n"
"I hoped for to come to fruition."
msgstr ""
"Зсув, що вже виник, надто великий. Цей світ, мабуть, не зазнає бажаного\n"
"мені руйнування."

#. Key: RCL7_075
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私は思う。
#. JA:   今一度この世界を見守ろう、と。
#. JA:   
msgctxt "RCL7_075"
msgid "Therefore, I believe that this time, I will merely watch..."
msgstr "Я вирішила цього разу просто спостерігати за світом."

#. Key: RCL7_076
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Narrator
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そしてもし、また新たなズレが生まれたとしたら、
#. JA:   その時は私の持てる力全てを使い
#. JA:   この世界を崩壊へと導く手助けをしよう、と。
msgctxt "RCL7_076"
msgid ""
"...and if, by chance, a new shift comes into being, I will use every ounce of power\n"
"under my command to help this world collapse."
msgstr ""
"І якщо виникне новий зсув, я використаю всю свою силу, щоб\n"
"допомогти цьому світу прийти до краху."

#. Key: RCL7_078
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……ふぅ。ようやく追い着きましたな。
msgctxt "RCL7_078"
msgid "My goodness... Ah, it would seem I have at least caught up with you."
msgstr "Фух... Нарешті наздогнав вас."

#. Key: RCL7_079
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……あら、ヴァルケンハイン。
msgctxt "RCL7_079"
msgid "Ah, Valkenhayn."
msgstr "...А, Валькенгайне."

#. Key: RCL7_080
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: “今回は”もう、お帰りになられた方がよろしいかと……。
msgctxt "RCL7_080"
msgid "I think perhaps it is time the young madam called it a night... This time around..."
msgstr "Цього разу вам уже, мабуть, варто повернутися додому..."

#. Key: RCL7_081
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……そうね。
#. JA:   私もそう考えていたわ。
msgctxt "RCL7_081"
msgid "...An excellent suggestion. It would be best if we were to retire."
msgstr "...Так. Я й сама про це думала."

#. Key: RCL7_082
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 左様でございましたか……。
msgctxt "RCL7_082"
msgid "Very well..."
msgstr "Он як..."

#. Key: RCL7_083
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 帰ったら紅茶を淹れてちょうだい。
#. JA:   そして、ゆっくりと待ちましょう。
#. JA:   時間はまだたっぷりとあるのだもの……。
msgctxt "RCL7_083"
msgid ""
"I shall desire tea when we return. You will prepare it.\n"
"And then, we shall wait. After all, we have all the time in the world..."
msgstr ""
"Повернемося — завари мені чаю. І спокійно почекаємо. Адже часу в нас\n"
"іще вдосталь..."

#. Key: RCL8_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 疲れたけれど、たまにはあんなことがあるのもいいわ。
#. JA:   同じ芝居ばかりを見せられ続けるのにも、
#. JA:   飽き飽きしていたところだったから……。
msgctxt "RCL8_002"
msgid ""
"I'm rather tired, but I suppose this time away from the drudgery of the castle has\n"
"done me good. No play retains its drama in repetition."
msgstr ""
"Я втомилася, та час від часу й такі пригоди не завадять. Мені вже\n"
"набридло дивитися ту саму виставу знов і знов..."

#. Key: RCL8_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL8_004"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL8_005
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……ねえ、ヴァルケンハイン。
#. JA:   もしもお父様がこの世界を観たら、何てお思いになるかしら？
msgctxt "RCL8_005"
msgid ""
"...Valkenhayn.\n"
"If father could see the world as it is now, what would he think?"
msgstr ""
"...Валькенгайне. Як гадаєш, що подумав би батько, якби побачив цей\n"
"світ?"

#. Key: RCL8_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それは唐突かつ難しいご質問ですな。
msgctxt "RCL8_006"
msgid "I do not quite know how I should answer that question, madam."
msgstr "Це несподіване й непросте запитання, пані."

#. Key: RCL8_007
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 最近、思うことがあるのよ。
#. JA:   私はこの城の当主として真に相応しいのか、と……。
msgctxt "RCL8_007"
msgid ""
"I have been plagued by doubt of late, Valkenhayn. Do you...do you think I belong\n"
"at the head of this family? As the inheritor of this mansion?"
msgstr ""
"Останнім часом я замислююся... Чи справді я гідна бути господинею\n"
"цього замку?"

#. Key: RCL8_008
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……レイチェル様らしからぬお言葉で。
msgctxt "RCL8_008"
msgid ""
"You will forgive my impertinence, milady, but such a question seems...out of\n"
"character."
msgstr "...На вас це не схоже, пані Рейчел."

#. Key: RCL8_009
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そうかしら？
msgctxt "RCL8_009"
msgid "Is that so?"
msgstr "Невже?"

#. Key: RCL8_010
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: いえ……そうね。
#. JA:   少し疲れているのかもしれないわ。
msgctxt "RCL8_010"
msgid "No, I suppose you are right. Perhaps I am simply tired."
msgstr "Ні... Ти маєш рацію. Мабуть, я трохи втомилася."

#. Key: RCL8_011
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……今日はもう、お休みになられますか？
msgctxt "RCL8_011"
msgid "Do you with to retire to the bedchamber? I shall have it made up—"
msgstr "...Може, вам уже час відпочити?"

#. Key: RCL8_012
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: もう少しここにいさせて。
#. JA:   眠ってしまったとしても、もう少しだけ……。
msgctxt "RCL8_012"
msgid ""
"Let me stay here a little longer.\n"
"Even if I fall asleep...I should like to stay here a little longer."
msgstr ""
"Дозволь мені ще трохи побути тут. Навіть якщо засну — ще зовсім\n"
"трохи..."

#. Key: RCL8_013
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 畏まりました。
#. JA:   それでは膝かけをお持ちいたします。
msgctxt "RCL8_013"
msgid "Very well then, madam. I shall bring you a blanket."
msgstr "Слухаюся. Тоді я принесу вам коцика."

#. Key: RCL8_014
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ええ……お願い……。
msgctxt "RCL8_014"
msgid "Yes...please..."
msgstr "Так... будь ласка..."

#. Key: RCL8_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL8_016"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL8_018
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Valkenhayn
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 先代……貴方様が“生み出した”レイチェル様は、
#. JA:   立派に成長されておりますよ……。
msgctxt "RCL8_018"
msgid "Ah, sir... If you could only see your daughter now... Your Rachel has grown so much..."
msgstr ""
"Господарю... Якби ви могли бачити вашу доньку, Рейчел виросла на\n"
"славу..."

#. Key: RCL9_001
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そこの貴方。
msgctxt "RCL9_001"
msgid "You there."
msgstr "Агов, ти."

#. Key: RCL9_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL9_002"
msgid "Hm!?"
msgstr "Гм?!"

#. Key: RCL9_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: なッ！　この私が接近を感知できなかっただと!?
msgctxt "RCL9_004"
msgid "Wha-!? How did I not detect you closing in!?"
msgstr "Що?! Я не відчув, як ти наблизилася?!"

#. Key: RCL9_005
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ココノエに会いたいの。
#. JA:   協力してもらえるかしら？
msgctxt "RCL9_005"
msgid "I need to speak with Kokonoe. You will assist me."
msgstr "Я хочу побачитися з Коконое. Допоможеш мені?"

#. Key: RCL9_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ココノエに、だと……？　貴様、何者だ？
msgctxt "RCL9_006"
msgid "Speak with Kokonoe...? Who the hell are you!?"
msgstr "З Коконое...? Ти хто така?"

#. Key: RCL9_007
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方が知る必要はないわ。いいから早く準備なさい。
msgctxt "RCL9_007"
msgid "That is none of your concern. Why have you not begun preparations?"
msgstr "Тобі це знати не обов'язково. Краще мерщій готуйся."

#. Key: RCL9_008
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 準備、だと……？
msgctxt "RCL9_008"
msgid "Preparations...?"
msgstr "Готуватися, кажеш...?"

#. Key: RCL9_009
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そこの「転移装置」のことよ。
msgctxt "RCL9_009"
msgid "I am referring to your matter transference device. "
msgstr "Я про той «пристрій перенесення»."

#. Key: RCL9_010
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……私が“はいそうですか”と従うように見えるのか？
msgctxt "RCL9_010"
msgid "...Hah! Give me one reason why I should listen to you!"
msgstr "...Думаєш, я отак просто погоджуся й виконуватиму твої накази?"

#. Key: RCL9_011
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: その転移装置はココノエのところに繋がっている。
#. JA:   そしてココノエ側からしか起動はできない……。
msgctxt "RCL9_011"
msgid ""
"I know that it leads to wherever Kokonoe has hidden herself, and I know that\n"
"only she can activate it."
msgstr ""
"Цей пристрій з'єднаний із місцем, де перебуває Коконое. І запустити його\n"
"може лише вона зі свого боку..."

#. Key: RCL9_012
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: !?　なぜそれを……!?
msgctxt "RCL9_012"
msgid "Wha-!? How do you know that!?"
msgstr "?! Звідки ти це знаєш?!"

#. Key: RCL9_013
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方は何も知らないのね。
#. JA:   自分が転移装置の鍵になっているなんて
#. JA:   想像したことものないのだろうけれど……。
msgctxt "RCL9_013"
msgid ""
"Must I explain everything? Have you never considered that you are the key which\n"
"activates the device?"
msgstr ""
"Ти зовсім нічого не знаєш. Певно, навіть не здогадуєшся, що сам є\n"
"ключем до цього пристрою..."

#. Key: RCL9_014
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私が……鍵……？　貴様は一体……。
msgctxt "RCL9_014"
msgid "I'm...the key...? Just how much do you know...!?"
msgstr "Я... ключ...? Хто ж ти така...?"

#. Key: RCL9_015
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ああ、もう……時間が惜しいわ。
#. JA:   拒むのなら、いいからさっさと戦いなさい。
msgctxt "RCL9_015"
msgid ""
"Oh dear... This is going nowhere.\n"
"If you find me a nuisance, why not simply attack me?"
msgstr "Ох, годі... Часу обмаль. Якщо відмовляєшся, просто напади на мене."

#. Key: RCL9_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方のモード変換が、
#. JA:   “こちら側”から転移装置を起動させるための鍵なのよ。
msgctxt "RCL9_016"
msgid "When you change modes, you will activate the key on this end!"
msgstr "Зміна твого режиму — ключ до запуску пристрою з «цього боку»."

#. Key: RCL9_017
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……何!?
msgctxt "RCL9_017"
msgid "...What!?"
msgstr "...Що?!"

#. Key: RCL9_023
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……故障かしら。
msgctxt "RCL9_023"
msgid "...Is something wrong?"
msgstr "...Зламався?"

#. Key: RCL9_024
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: さも全てを知っているような口を利いておいて……この結果か。
#. JA:   貴様が何者かなどどうでも良くなった。
#. JA:   私の気が変わらぬうちに消えるがいい。
msgctxt "RCL9_024"
msgid ""
"So you speak as if you know it all... And this happens?\n"
"I don't even care who you are anymore.\n"
"You'd better get out of my sight before I change my mind..."
msgstr ""
"Говорила так, ніби знаєш усе... І ось результат. Мені вже байдуже, хто\n"
"ти. Забирайся, поки я не передумав."

#. Key: RCL9_025
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ココノエは起動の鍵を変えたのね。
#. JA:   これも“ズレ”ということかしら……。
msgctxt "RCL9_025"
msgid "It would appear Kokonoe has altered the activation key. Perhaps this is a shift? Hm..."
msgstr "Коконое змінила ключ запуску. Мабуть, і це наслідок «зсуву»..."

#. Key: RCL9_026
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 何をしている。
#. JA:   早く立ち去れ！
msgctxt "RCL9_026"
msgid "What are you doing!? Leave!"
msgstr "Чого стоїш? Іди звідси!"

#. Key: RCL9_027
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 分かったわよ。
#. JA:   “今回は”あきらめてあげるわ。それでいいんでしょう？
msgctxt "RCL9_027"
msgid ""
"Very well. I will take my leave of you for this performance. That is what you desire,\n"
"correct?"
msgstr "Зрозуміла. «Цього разу» я відступлю. Тебе це влаштує?"

#. Key: RCL9_029
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 不可解な娘だ……。
msgctxt "RCL9_029"
msgid "I don't think I will ever understand that girl..."
msgstr "Дивна дівчина..."

#. Key: RCL9_034
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: この力……貴様、一体……？
msgctxt "RCL9_034"
msgid "This power... What on earth...are you!?"
msgstr "Така сила... Хто ж ти така...?"

#. Key: RCL9_035
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 貴方がなかなか本気を出さないから悪いのよ。
#. JA:   すんなりとやってくれていれば傷付かずにすんだのに……。
msgctxt "RCL9_035"
msgid ""
"Perhaps you shouldn't have held back, mechanical man. If you'd only obeyed me\n"
"when I first requested your assistance..."
msgstr ""
"Сам винен, що не поспішав битися на повну силу. Одразу зробив би, як я\n"
"просила, — не довелося б терпіти рани..."

#. Key: RCL9_037
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 何っ!?　起動した、だと……。
msgctxt "RCL9_037"
msgid "It...activated!?"
msgstr "Що?! Він запустився...?"

#. Key: RCL9_038
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: だから、さっき説明したでしょう？
#. JA:   “あの子”らしい面倒で巧妙な仕掛けよね。
#. JA:   外側からはそう簡単には入れないわ……。
msgctxt "RCL9_038"
msgid ""
"Have we not been over this? This dreadful mess makes it difficult to access her\n"
"from the outside. How like her..."
msgstr ""
"Я ж тобі пояснювала. Клопіткий і хитромудрий механізм — саме в дусі\n"
"«тієї дівчини». Ззовні сюди так просто не потрапити..."

#. Key: RCL9_039
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: そうそう、協力には感謝しているわ。
#. JA:   それではごきげんよう、「赤鬼」さん。
msgctxt "RCL9_039"
msgid ""
"Thank you for your assistance.\n"
"Until we meet again, Mr. Red Devil."
msgstr "І ще: дякую за допомогу. Бувай, «Червоний демоне»."

#. Key: RCL9_041
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Tager
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 何者なのだ……。
#. JA:   ココノエ……大丈夫なのか……？
msgctxt "RCL9_041"
msgid ""
"Who the hell is she...?\n"
"Kokonoe...are you gonna be OK...?"
msgstr "Хто вона така...? Коконое... з нею все буде гаразд...?"

#. Key: RCL10_002
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 本当に、面倒な仕掛けね。
msgctxt "RCL10_002"
msgid "Goodness gracious, how terribly bothersome..."
msgstr "Який же клопіткий пристрій."

#. Key: RCL10_003
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……レイチェル？
#. JA:   どうやってここに来た？
msgctxt "RCL10_003"
msgid "...Rachel? How did you get in here?"
msgstr "...Рейчел? Як ти сюди потрапила?"

#. Key: RCL10_004
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 「鍵」を使って、よ。
msgctxt "RCL10_004"
msgid "Why, with the key, of course."
msgstr "Скористалася «ключем»."

#. Key: RCL10_005
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ああ、そうか……。
#. JA:   お前は全て“観てる”んだっけな……
msgctxt "RCL10_005"
msgid "Ah, that's right... You can see everything, can't you?"
msgstr "А, точно... Ти ж усе «бачиш»..."

#. Key: RCL10_006
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: それを理解しているということは、
#. JA:   もう“気付いて”いるのね？
msgctxt "RCL10_006"
msgid "If you know that much, surely you've noticed..."
msgstr "Якщо ти це розумієш, то вже й «помітила», так?"

#. Key: RCL10_007
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: まあな……。
#. JA:   それで色々とやってはみたんだが……。
#. JA:   どうやら失敗に終わったようだ。
msgctxt "RCL10_007"
msgid "Yeah, I have, and I've tried about a million things, but none of 'em work. All failures."
msgstr "Ну так... Спробувала дещо зробити, але, схоже, усе скінчилося невдачею."

#. Key: RCL10_008
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 確かに……成功とは言い難いわね。
#. JA:   でも、今回は気付くのが以<ruby>ま</ruby>前<ruby>え</ruby>よりも遙かに早かったわ。
msgctxt "RCL10_008"
msgid ""
"Indeed... Success comes rarely and never easily. I must congratulate you. You did\n"
"discover it much faster this time."
msgstr ""
"Так... Успіхом це важко назвати. Але цього разу ти помітила все\n"
"набагато раніше, ніж колись."

#. Key: RCL10_009
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……そうか。
#. JA:   それならこの先、幾ばくかの望みはある、か。
msgctxt "RCL10_009"
msgid "...I see. Then there might be hope for us yet..."
msgstr "...Он як. Значить, надалі в нас іще є певна надія."

#. Key: RCL10_010
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: さあ、どうでしょうね……。
#. JA:   貴方次第だとは思うけれど……。
msgctxt "RCL10_010"
msgid "One can only hope. I believe, however, that task is yours."
msgstr "Хтозна... Гадаю, усе залежить від тебе."

#. Key: RCL10_011
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 私であって私でない私次第だからな……。
#. JA:   責任を感じるような感じないような……不思議な気持ちだよ。
msgctxt "RCL10_011"
msgid ""
"So it's up to me...who isn't really me... I kind of feel responsible, but at the same\n"
"time, I don't... Weird."
msgstr ""
"Від мене, яка водночас є мною і не є... Дивне відчуття: наче й\n"
"відповідальність моя, а наче й ні."

#. Key: RCL10_013
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……と、折角来てくれたところ悪いんだが、
#. JA:   これからあちこち飛び回らなくてはいけないんだ。
msgctxt "RCL10_013"
msgid ""
"Well, I'd love to stick around and shoot the shit, but I've got places to be, things to\n"
"do..."
msgstr ""
"...Та хоч ти й завітала, мушу бігти у справах. Мені треба побувати ще в\n"
"багатьох місцях."

#. Key: RCL10_014
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 構わないわ。
#. JA:   ただ、ひとつだけ、いいかしら？
msgctxt "RCL10_014"
msgid ""
"Oh, I wouldn't dream of keeping you from your important work, but there is one thing\n"
"I thought you should know."
msgstr "Не заперечую. Але можна спершу сказати тобі дещо?"

#. Key: RCL10_015
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: なんだ？
msgctxt "RCL10_015"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr "Що саме?"

#. Key: RCL10_016
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 「テルミ」が現れたわよ。
msgctxt "RCL10_016"
msgid "Your old friend Terumi has returned."
msgstr "З'явився «Терумі»."

#. Key: RCL10_017
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: なん、だと……？
msgctxt "RCL10_017"
msgid "What did you say...?"
msgstr "Що... ти сказала?"

#. Key: RCL10_018
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: かなり浅いところにまでね。
msgctxt "RCL10_018"
msgid "He's rather close now, I would say."
msgstr "І вже досить близько до поверхні."

#. Key: RCL10_019
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
msgctxt "RCL10_019"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. Key: RCL10_021
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: レイチェル……。
msgctxt "RCL10_021"
msgid "Rachel..."
msgstr "Рейчел..."

#. Key: RCL10_022
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……分かっているわ。
#. JA:   手を出すな、と言うのでしょう？
msgctxt "RCL10_022"
msgid "...Oh, you needn't tell me. You would rather I stayed out of this, wouldn't you?"
msgstr "...Я знаю. Ти хочеш, щоб я не втручалася, так?"

#. Key: RCL10_023
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: フン……、やっぱりお見通しなんだな、なんでも……。
msgctxt "RCL10_023"
msgid "Well, I guess you just know it all, don't you?"
msgstr "Хм... Від тебе, як завжди, нічого не приховаєш..."

#. Key: RCL10_024
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Kokonoe
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ヤツは私が必ず消滅させる。
#. JA:   ヤツの存在を……私は認めない！！！
msgctxt "RCL10_024"
msgid "I'm gonna take him down, you just watch. I can't let a bastard like that exist!"
msgstr "Я неодмінно зітру його з лиця землі. Я не дозволю йому існувати!!!"

#. Key: RCL10_025
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: ……だったら、頑張りなさい。
#. JA:   “今回”、私が言いたいのはそれだけよ。
msgctxt "RCL10_025"
msgid ""
"Then I wish you the best of luck. Perhaps this time around, you will achieve that\n"
"which you desire."
msgstr "...Тоді постарайся. «Цього разу» це все, що я хотіла тобі сказати."

#. Key: RCL10_027
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 今の私にできる事は、本当にそれだけだった。
msgctxt "RCL10_027"
msgid "...That was all I could do."
msgstr "Це й справді було все, що я тоді могла зробити."

#. Key: RCL10_028
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   私はこの舞台に降りる事を許された役者ではないから。
#. JA:   私にできるのは、観客として役者達を励ますことだけだ。
msgctxt "RCL10_028"
msgid ""
"\n"
"I am a patron of this play, however unwilling, not an actor.\n"
"I may cheer the cast, the stage itself is forbidden to me."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Мені не дозволено бути акторкою, що виходить на цю сцену. Я можу\n"
"лише підбадьорювати акторів як глядачка."

#. Key: RCL10_029
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   それを哀しんだこともあった。
#. JA:   それを受け入れたこともあった。
msgctxt "RCL10_029"
msgid ""
"\n"
"At times, I have regretted it.\n"
"At other times, I have welcomed and accepted my place."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Бувало, я сумувала через це. Бувало, приймала це як належне."

#. Key: RCL10_030
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   けれど今の私はまた、違う心を持っている。
msgctxt "RCL10_030"
msgid ""
"\n"
"But this time...I feel a change of heart."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Та зараз я відчуваю щось інше."

#. Key: RCL10_031
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   それは微かな希望。
msgctxt "RCL10_031"
msgid ""
"\n"
"There is hope—the finest of threads—but it is there."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Це — слабка надія."

#. Key: RCL10_032
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   私という小さな存在が
#. JA:   この舞台を大きく変えるかもしれない―――そういう期待。
msgctxt "RCL10_032"
msgid ""
"\n"
"Perhaps even I, a simple member of the audience, can change the play,\n"
"if only in a small way."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Надія на те, що навіть така мала істота, як я, може докорінно змінити\n"
"цю виставу."

#. Key: RCL10_033
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   希望を胸に、私は家路へと着く。
msgctxt "RCL10_033"
msgid ""
"\n"
"I begin my long walk home with hopes high."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Із цією надією в серці я вирушаю додому."

#. Key: RCL10_034
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   　　　　　　　　　やがてこの世界は終わり、また始まるだろう。
msgctxt "RCL10_034"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　Before long, the world will end again and begin anew."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　Невдовзі цей світ скінчиться і почнеться знову."

#. Key: RCL10_035
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   　　　そして私の投げ掛けた言葉の種が、どう育ち行くのかを私は見守る。
msgctxt "RCL10_035"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　I will sit, and I will watch the seeds I have planted, and perhaps\n"
"　　　　　　their growth will bring the change my play so desperately needs."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　А я спостерігатиму, як проростуть зерна слів, посіяні мною."

#. Key: RCL10_036
#. Source: story/storytext_mainrc (data/Story/Text/eng/storytext_mainrc.pac)
#. Speaker: Rachel
#. Context: Rachel story route (POV: Rachel)
#. JA: 
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   
#. JA:   　　　　　　　　それが観客である私の、最上の愉しみ方なのだ―――。
msgctxt "RCL10_036"
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　After all, what more could a grateful audience ask for?"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"　　　　　　Для мене, глядачки, це найкраща розвага..."
